(521519, 52051, 3102, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a very nice shot, but it is extremely pixelated.  Not sure what happened here, but the quality really suffered somewhere along the way.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a very nice shot, but it is extremely pixelated.  Not sure what happened here, but the quality really suffered somewhere along the way.', '2003-12-24 00:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(521520, 51986, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... a boundary... if you wanna ride the train, you gotta buy a ticket... excellent theme :)</td>', 'excellent shot... a boundary... if you wanna ride the train, you gotta buy a ticket... excellent theme :)', '2003-12-24 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(521521, 52038, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like the kind of snow you''d see around Altoona...</td>', 'Looks like the kind of snow you''d see around Altoona...', '2003-12-24 00:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521522, 51540, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... great theme... very emotive in itself.  if i forget to add this to my favs, please remind me :)</td>', 'excellent work... great theme... very emotive in itself.  if i forget to add this to my favs, please remind me :)', '2003-12-24 00:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(521523, 51928, 327, '<td valign="top">Tells a story. Good job, good light and focus.</td>', 'Tells a story. Good job, good light and focus.', '2003-12-24 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(521524, 52071, 3102, '<td valign="top">Man, you really put a lot of work into this one!  Quite a clever concept!</td>', 'Man, you really put a lot of work into this one!  Quite a clever concept!', '2003-12-24 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(521525, 51994, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, i  love the backlighting</td>', 'This is so pretty, i  love the backlighting', '2003-12-24 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(521526, 51591, 772, '<td valign="top">i think this is a beautiful composition.. i just wish the exposure level was a bit higher to create some highlights and more contrast.</td>', 'i think this is a beautiful composition.. i just wish the exposure level was a bit higher to create some highlights and more contrast.', '2003-12-24 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(521527, 52092, 327, '<td valign="top">Dizzying, but oh so awesome. Very cool. Looks like you went off the edge. :) Good job.</td>', 'Dizzying, but oh so awesome. Very cool. Looks like you went off the edge. :) Good job.', '2003-12-24 00:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(521528, 52124, 772, '<td valign="top">interersting concept here and the theme is well taken... i think this shot may be suffering a tad of motion blur... the text on the tombstone would be well served a bit sharper :)</td>', 'interersting concept here and the theme is well taken... i think this shot may be suffering a tad of motion blur... the text on the tombstone would be well served a bit sharper :)', '2003-12-24 00:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521530, 51899, 772, '<td valign="top">i can smell this orange and it''s making me thirsty for some fresh squeezed OJ... i love the highlight along the edge of the knife blade... excellent still life :)</td>', 'i can smell this orange and it''s making me thirsty for some fresh squeezed OJ... i love the highlight along the edge of the knife blade... excellent still life :)', '2003-12-24 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(521532, 52105, 772, '<td valign="top">ah yes... home sweet home :) looks like it was a tad chilly up there this week :)</td>', 'ah yes... home sweet home :) looks like it was a tad chilly up there this week :)', '2003-12-24 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521533, 51928, 772, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this.. the person in the photo puts the bridge size into context... nice work :)</td>', 'I love shots like this.. the person in the photo puts the bridge size into context... nice work :)', '2003-12-24 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(521539, 51642, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely focus. I might suggest some burn tool over the rocks to tone them down a hair. Love the light on the water. 8</td>', 'Lovely focus. I might suggest some burn tool over the rocks to tone them down a hair. Love the light on the water. 8', '2003-12-24 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(521543, 51585, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nice crisp shot. Good light, focus.</td>', 'Really nice crisp shot. Good light, focus.', '2003-12-24 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(521546, 51574, 7033, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the toning you have added to this shot-- it works very well to emphasize the textures in the rock and the contrast to the sharp, angular railing.  However, the uneven horizon is pretty distracting, in my opinion, and you might have been better served to get more of the rock at the left in the frame, particularly at the top of the frame.<br/> <br/>PS -- didn''t score down for it, but you are missing a couple of pixels along the left and top edges.  This may have happened during cropping/resizing.</td>', 'I particularly like the toning you have added to this shot-- it works very well to emphasize the textures in the rock and the contrast to the sharp, angular railing.  However, the uneven horizon is pretty distracting, in my opinion, and you might have been better served to get more of the rock at the left in the frame, particularly at the top of the frame. PS -- didn''t score down for it, but you are missing a couple of pixels along the left and top edges.  This may have happened during cropping/resizing.', '2003-12-24 00:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521550, 51540, 13749, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the new HDTV flat screen commercials - nice idea and execution.  might have wanted to spot edit that bit/speck out in front of your forehead.  i also wonder if taking off the ring might have improved this in any way (much of the emphasis, for me at least, seems to be on the ring).</td>', 'reminds me of the new HDTV flat screen commercials - nice idea and execution.  might have wanted to spot edit that bit/speck out in front of your forehead.  i also wonder if taking off the ring might have improved this in any way (much of the emphasis, for me at least, seems to be on the ring).', '2003-12-24 00:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(521552, 51854, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning light and focus. Really nice. Kudos</td>', 'Stunning light and focus. Really nice. Kudos', '2003-12-24 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(521554, 52057, 327, '<td valign="top">kudos. Beautiful lighting, colors and composition. Nice nice. 9</td>', 'kudos. Beautiful lighting, colors and composition. Nice nice. 9', '2003-12-24 00:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(521557, 51991, 772, '<td valign="top">great shot...</td>', 'great shot...', '2003-12-24 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(521559, 51388, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic focus and light with vivid colors. Really neat.</td>', 'Fantastic focus and light with vivid colors. Really neat.', '2003-12-24 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(521561, 51877, 14952, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, bust seems to be a bit out of focus to me</td>', 'a nice idea, bust seems to be a bit out of focus to me', '2003-12-24 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(521563, 52108, 13749, '<td valign="top">i like the concept, but the picture is a bit yellow.. might want to color balance in camera or during post-editing.  stick also seems a bit out of place, but it doesn''t seem like there''s much you could''ve done about that.</td>', 'i like the concept, but the picture is a bit yellow.. might want to color balance in camera or during post-editing.  stick also seems a bit out of place, but it doesn''t seem like there''s much you could''ve done about that.', '2003-12-24 00:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(521564, 51381, 15242, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus and there isn''t a lot of interest in the photo.</td>', 'Seems out of focus and there isn''t a lot of interest in the photo.', '2003-12-24 00:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(521565, 52057, 14952, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot and it fits the challenge perfectly.  The top part of the lemon on the glass seems oversaturated or something to me.  It is a very bright yellow and doesn''t seem to fit, but other than that it is very good.</td>', 'I like this a lot and it fits the challenge perfectly.  The top part of the lemon on the glass seems oversaturated or something to me.  It is a very bright yellow and doesn''t seem to fit, but other than that it is very good.', '2003-12-24 00:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521573, 51429, 772, '<td valign="top">I would love to hear your logic behind this border and how it enhances the image.  I believe it distracts from the image.  It requires me to look at the border and wonder why rather than look at the image itself.</td>', 'I would love to hear your logic behind this border and how it enhances the image.  I believe it distracts from the image.  It requires me to look at the border and wonder why rather than look at the image itself.', '2003-12-24 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(521576, 51899, 6388, '<td valign="top">if yours is anything like mine it''s getting hammered for being too literal ;).  I like your shot.  not to thrilled with the border, but i like the textures of the knife and orange.</td>', 'if yours is anything like mine it''s getting hammered for being too literal ;).  I like your shot.  not to thrilled with the border, but i like the textures of the knife and orange.', '2003-12-24 00:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(521578, 51574, 15242, '<td valign="top">I think it might be better in color???  I''d have to see it to make the call.</td>', 'I think it might be better in color???  I''d have to see it to make the call.', '2003-12-24 00:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
