(521589, 52112, 6388, '<td valign="top">if you bump the contrast just a weeeee bit up and the lightness down a weeee bit you''ll lose those little highlights on the horizon.  I''d like to see it with full-on dark/light contrast between the elements.   nice thought adding the benches in.  Pedro</td>', 'if you bump the contrast just a weeeee bit up and the lightness down a weeee bit you''ll lose those little highlights on the horizon.  I''d like to see it with full-on dark/light contrast between the elements.   nice thought adding the benches in.  Pedro', '2003-12-24 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(521591, 51772, 14952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I only wish that yellow object in the upper left weren''t there.</td>', 'Beautiful... I only wish that yellow object in the upper left weren''t there.', '2003-12-24 00:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(521595, 52080, 15242, '<td valign="top">The water seems real grainy.  Too much post processing?  Nice action shot, I like the capture of the splashing.</td>', 'The water seems real grainy.  Too much post processing?  Nice action shot, I like the capture of the splashing.', '2003-12-24 00:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(521598, 51517, 14952, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I like the creativity, and a nice shot as well.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I like the creativity, and a nice shot as well.', '2003-12-24 00:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(521599, 52032, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice ''angle'' on the challenge.  no really - i like the way you''ve angled this pic - the middle bricks turned out like little arrows.  well done.</td>', 'nice ''angle'' on the challenge.  no really - i like the way you''ve angled this pic - the middle bricks turned out like little arrows.  well done.', '2003-12-24 00:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(521600, 51432, 772, '<td valign="top">a bit repulsive.</td>', 'a bit repulsive.', '2003-12-24 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(521601, 51730, 6388, '<td valign="top">these are really hard to expose, since the snow is so reflective.  maybe a little fill flash for the foliage up front?  not sure.  nice idea either way.  Pedro</td>', 'these are really hard to expose, since the snow is so reflective.  maybe a little fill flash for the foliage up front?  not sure.  nice idea either way.  Pedro', '2003-12-24 00:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(521603, 52112, 14952, '<td valign="top">wow, great shot... I wish that the entire tree were captured, and that the water on the right wasn''t quite as blown, but other than that it is absoultely a perfect shot.</td>', 'wow, great shot... I wish that the entire tree were captured, and that the water on the right wasn''t quite as blown, but other than that it is absoultely a perfect shot.', '2003-12-24 00:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(521604, 52091, 15242, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to get this shot, using an object to block the sun.  I can''t make it work unless I can block the entire sun.  If any gets through it takes over the picture.</td>', 'I''ve tried to get this shot, using an object to block the sun.  I can''t make it work unless I can block the entire sun.  If any gets through it takes over the picture.', '2003-12-24 00:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(521605, 52074, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract and excellent lighting :)</td>', 'very nice abstract and excellent lighting :)', '2003-12-24 00:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(521606, 52100, 6388, '<td valign="top">something a little surreal about this, but i love it.  great take on the challenge. not contrasy enough for my taste, but still a solid 7 (my highest vote thus far)<br/>Pedro</td>', 'something a little surreal about this, but i love it.  great take on the challenge. not contrasy enough for my taste, but still a solid 7 (my highest vote thus far)Pedro', '2003-12-24 00:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(521608, 52046, 15242, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t see any interest or any artisitic merit to this shot.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t see any interest or any artisitic merit to this shot.', '2003-12-24 00:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(521609, 51860, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot :)</td>', 'beautiful shot :)', '2003-12-24 00:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(521610, 52068, 14952, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective on this!</td>', 'I really like the perspective on this!', '2003-12-24 00:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(521612, 52011, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and texture, but no real interest and i can''t make out what it is.</td>', 'Nice shapes and texture, but no real interest and i can''t make out what it is.', '2003-12-24 00:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(521614, 51928, 14952, '<td valign="top">I think this could be improved a bit by including more (probably the entire) bridge, or less of the bridge, but this a great creative idea for the challenge.</td>', 'I think this could be improved a bit by including more (probably the entire) bridge, or less of the bridge, but this a great creative idea for the challenge.', '2003-12-24 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(521615, 51415, 6388, '<td valign="top">let me be the first (or second or third fourth fifth) to mention the border.  drop shadows and ''creative'' borders do not fare well here.  mostly because they''re ugly ;).  as for the shot - it lacks some definition in content (no clear theme) but i see what youwere going for, and I like the B&amp;W idea.  a nice addition to your portfolio either way.  Pedro</td>', 'let me be the first (or second or third fourth fifth) to mention the border.  drop shadows and ''creative'' borders do not fare well here.  mostly because they''re ugly ;).  as for the shot - it lacks some definition in content (no clear theme) but i see what youwere going for, and I like the B&W idea.  a nice addition to your portfolio either way.  Pedro', '2003-12-24 00:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(521616, 52121, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too much white space on the top and not very interesting.</td>', 'Too much white space on the top and not very interesting.', '2003-12-24 00:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(521618, 52051, 14952, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a very beautiful image, however it is incredibly noisy.  Also the black object at the bottom of the screen is a bit distracting from the rest of the image.</td>', 'This looks to be a very beautiful image, however it is incredibly noisy.  Also the black object at the bottom of the screen is a bit distracting from the rest of the image.', '2003-12-24 00:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(521619, 52088, 6888, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but the blurriness is very distracting</td>', 'interesting idea, but the blurriness is very distracting', '2003-12-24 00:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(521620, 51992, 14952, '<td valign="top">Great shot and creative title</td>', 'Great shot and creative title', '2003-12-24 00:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(521626, 52010, 15242, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of shots like this, but here is my $.02.  A fresh or frozen pee would be much brighter green and may make it better (this one is canned, right?).  Also, a sheer black background would make it better.  The fabric contrasts with the smoothness of the plate.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of shots like this, but here is my $.02.  A fresh or frozen pee would be much brighter green and may make it better (this one is canned, right?).  Also, a sheer black background would make it better.  The fabric contrasts with the smoothness of the plate.', '2003-12-24 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(521627, 52074, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors...i love this.</td>', 'beautiful colors...i love this.', '2003-12-24 00:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(521628, 51704, 14952, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I love how the fencepost somewhat balances out the trees on the right.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I love how the fencepost somewhat balances out the trees on the right.', '2003-12-24 00:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(521630, 52124, 14952, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for the shot, I love the bright side of the stone.  However, it appears to have a bit of camera shake to me, and I''m not quite sure what the bright spot is supposed to represent on the left.</td>', 'This is a great idea for the shot, I love the bright side of the stone.  However, it appears to have a bit of camera shake to me, and I''m not quite sure what the bright spot is supposed to represent on the left.', '2003-12-24 00:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(521631, 52089, 9602, '<td valign="top">Would have like to have seen all the water in focus, the diffrent focus all over the picture is distracting.</td>', 'Would have like to have seen all the water in focus, the diffrent focus all over the picture is distracting.', '2003-12-24 00:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(521633, 51381, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice colour...soft focus (maybe not the best choice fora  knife - it kinda begs for sharp focus).  a little looser crop may have given this a little more purpose.  great texture at the top.  Pedro</td>', 'nice colour...soft focus (maybe not the best choice fora  knife - it kinda begs for sharp focus).  a little looser crop may have given this a little more purpose.  great texture at the top.  Pedro', '2003-12-24 00:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(521634, 52015, 14952, '<td valign="top">Foreground is a bit too dark in my opinion, it is tough to make out any details of the objects on the ground in the middle</td>', 'Foreground is a bit too dark in my opinion, it is tough to make out any details of the objects on the ground in the middle', '2003-12-24 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(521637, 51980, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice and kind of abstract.  with time i can even make out what it is ;)  a little hot in the bottom right corner, but nice overall.</td>', 'nice and kind of abstract.  with time i can even make out what it is ;)  a little hot in the bottom right corner, but nice overall.', '2003-12-24 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(521639, 51340, 6388, '<td valign="top">fabulous.  i was waiting for a razor shot - it was my other choice (that i didn''t go with).  I was also going to include the Edge Gel, but that would been too obvious...even for DPC.  love the grain and BW...a little hot on the lighting at the top left.  good idea.</td>', 'fabulous.  i was waiting for a razor shot - it was my other choice (that i didn''t go with).  I was also going to include the Edge Gel, but that would been too obvious...even for DPC.  love the grain and BW...a little hot on the lighting at the top left.  good idea.', '2003-12-24 00:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(521643, 51476, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting needs some help here.  either diffuse or use reflectors to quell thos shadows on the left rose.  nice idea.</td>', 'the lighting needs some help here.  either diffuse or use reflectors to quell thos shadows on the left rose.  nice idea.', '2003-12-24 01:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(521644, 51990, 6388, '<td valign="top">i love it.  one of the best I''ve seen so far. a little beam of light from below would have done wonders for the smoke. great idea, nice execution.</td>', 'i love it.  one of the best I''ve seen so far. a little beam of light from below would have done wonders for the smoke. great idea, nice execution.', '2003-12-24 01:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
