(521717, 51521, 7252, '<td valign="top">While a little too dark for me to really see what he is doing (I assume he is taking a piss) I like the idea. That is to take a photo of a social boundary. This is what I thought the challenge was supposed to be about. Although I could be wrong judging by all of the knifes and odd things people entered.</td>', 'While a little too dark for me to really see what he is doing (I assume he is taking a piss) I like the idea. That is to take a photo of a social boundary. This is what I thought the challenge was supposed to be about. Although I could be wrong judging by all of the knifes and odd things people entered.', '2003-12-24 02:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(521718, 51991, 8816, '<td valign="top">Very very good.  Excellent use of light and environment to set the mood of the picture.  I might have even used a slightly wider crop.  I have feeling this one is going to get bashed by voters, as most artistically inclined photos do.  Like to see it with a tad bit more contrast, but can''t say for sure, you might have gotten right on that line of perfection.  Iffy on the border, it seems too sleek for a shot of this power and raw emotion, perhaps after play around with an artistic border, or something.  I''ll definetly look you up after the challenge is over.  10 from me no problem!  AWESOME!</td>', 'Very very good.  Excellent use of light and environment to set the mood of the picture.  I might have even used a slightly wider crop.  I have feeling this one is going to get bashed by voters, as most artistically inclined photos do.  Like to see it with a tad bit more contrast, but can''t say for sure, you might have gotten right on that line of perfection.  Iffy on the border, it seems too sleek for a shot of this power and raw emotion, perhaps after play around with an artistic border, or something.  I''ll definetly look you up after the challenge is over.  10 from me no problem!  AWESOME!', '2003-12-24 02:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(521719, 51476, 8816, '<td valign="top">very cool concept, and very well done.  Excellent use of contrast to symolize your idea here.  Well taken photo''s as well, especially the dark one, that''s a hard shot too do, and you did it very admirably!  I hope this is legal!  Well done, 9 from me!</td>', 'very cool concept, and very well done.  Excellent use of contrast to symolize your idea here.  Well taken photo''s as well, especially the dark one, that''s a hard shot too do, and you did it very admirably!  I hope this is legal!  Well done, 9 from me!', '2003-12-24 02:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(521720, 52117, 13487, '<td valign="top">Nice photo... Personally, I would like to see a little more in focus... but it certainly conveys "on the edge".</td>', 'Nice photo... Personally, I would like to see a little more in focus... but it certainly conveys "on the edge".', '2003-12-24 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(521721, 52099, 7252, '<td valign="top">Not really sure of what to make of this. Is the white border a mistake? Did you increase the canvas size instead of resizing the image?</td>', 'Not really sure of what to make of this. Is the white border a mistake? Did you increase the canvas size instead of resizing the image?', '2003-12-24 02:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(521722, 52015, 8816, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  would''ve been even better if you submitted a larger version, it''s hard to see everything in this small a copy.  Nice composition, lovely colors, beautiful lighting.  A very interesting subject, and really sums up ''On The Edge'', as it seems that this is the last edge of land before the wide open blue sea.  And the fact that the dock seems to be falling apart makes it that much better.  an 8 from me, if you had submitted a larger shot a 9 would be in order, and I may have seen more to even give you a 10.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'cool shot.  would''ve been even better if you submitted a larger version, it''s hard to see everything in this small a copy.  Nice composition, lovely colors, beautiful lighting.  A very interesting subject, and really sums up ''On The Edge'', as it seems that this is the last edge of land before the wide open blue sea.  And the fact that the dock seems to be falling apart makes it that much better.  an 8 from me, if you had submitted a larger shot a 9 would be in order, and I may have seen more to even give you a 10.  Very nicely done!', '2003-12-24 02:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521723, 51429, 8816, '<td valign="top">This border doesn''t follow the mood of the photo at all.  If your shooting for effect by contrast, it''s lost.  DOF is awesome in this shot!  Well done there.  B&amp;W might''ve given it more impact, as that bit of red is distracting, and B&amp;W tends to direct more attention to shape and form.  A nice composition, but why is the bullet loading thingy (very technical eh?) open like that? Perhaps I''m overlooking something here, but the shot may have a more direct meaning if it were not open.  Very nice nonetheless 7 from me.</td>', 'This border doesn''t follow the mood of the photo at all.  If your shooting for effect by contrast, it''s lost.  DOF is awesome in this shot!  Well done there.  B&W might''ve given it more impact, as that bit of red is distracting, and B&W tends to direct more attention to shape and form.  A nice composition, but why is the bullet loading thingy (very technical eh?) open like that? Perhaps I''m overlooking something here, but the shot may have a more direct meaning if it were not open.  Very nice nonetheless 7 from me.', '2003-12-24 02:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(521724, 52057, 8816, '<td valign="top">very well taken shot, very well taken.  COlor is fantastic, as is the lighting.  Looks fantastic on the black background.  Would''ve been cool to include some of the green and yellow into the border, that just ties it all together.  A nice composition, unfortunately it may be lost to many folks as it''s a little unconventional for the challenge.  Or maybe that''s just me!  9 from me!</td>', 'very well taken shot, very well taken.  COlor is fantastic, as is the lighting.  Looks fantastic on the black background.  Would''ve been cool to include some of the green and yellow into the border, that just ties it all together.  A nice composition, unfortunately it may be lost to many folks as it''s a little unconventional for the challenge.  Or maybe that''s just me!  9 from me!', '2003-12-24 02:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(521727, 51591, 8816, '<td valign="top">exceptional!  A beautiful shot.  A little unconventional for the challenge, but fitting nonetheless.  You may lose votes from that, but not from me.  A wonderful composition, really gives me the feeling of the beauty of a moving river, and what lays around and within.  The muted colors are wonderful, and the exposure seems well done.  Perhaps a little lighter, but i don''t even know about that!  Well done, 10 from me!</td>', 'exceptional!  A beautiful shot.  A little unconventional for the challenge, but fitting nonetheless.  You may lose votes from that, but not from me.  A wonderful composition, really gives me the feeling of the beauty of a moving river, and what lays around and within.  The muted colors are wonderful, and the exposure seems well done.  Perhaps a little lighter, but i don''t even know about that!  Well done, 10 from me!', '2003-12-24 02:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(521729, 51451, 8816, '<td valign="top">This shot screams black and white too me!  The colors only distract from the illusion of the shot.  B&amp;W would emphasize what you are trying to demonstrate in the photo!  A nice composition nonethless, it fits the challenge, and fulfills one large requirement of photography very well - make the viewer look at something in a different way then normal!  Well done!  Love to see this in B&amp;W after the challenge is over.  Nonetheless 8 from me!</td>', 'This shot screams black and white too me!  The colors only distract from the illusion of the shot.  B&W would emphasize what you are trying to demonstrate in the photo!  A nice composition nonethless, it fits the challenge, and fulfills one large requirement of photography very well - make the viewer look at something in a different way then normal!  Well done!  Love to see this in B&W after the challenge is over.  Nonetheless 8 from me!', '2003-12-24 02:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
