(521918, 51651, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Doesn''t quite work for me, but I''ll be interested to see how it was done.  A little out of focus and too "blue".</td>', 'Very interesting.  Doesn''t quite work for me, but I''ll be interested to see how it was done.  A little out of focus and too "blue".', '2003-12-24 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(521919, 51780, 14614, '<td valign="top">The three images tell the story - tighter crop would have eliminated the white spot.</td>', 'The three images tell the story - tighter crop would have eliminated the white spot.', '2003-12-24 07:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(521920, 51928, 14401, '<td valign="top">Good take on the subject.</td>', 'Good take on the subject.', '2003-12-24 07:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(521921, 51337, 14614, '<td valign="top">Draws my eye in but I''m not sure to what.  I would like something of interest at the end.  Left side seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Draws my eye in but I''m not sure to what.  I would like something of interest at the end.  Left side seems a bit out of focus.', '2003-12-24 07:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(521922, 51652, 13759, '<td valign="top">This match perfectly to Macro III! It´s stunning! Very well done.</td>', 'This match perfectly to Macro III! It´s stunning! Very well done.', '2003-12-24 07:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(521923, 51728, 14401, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is the edge or boundary of, but this is really a lovely photo!</td>', 'Not sure what this is the edge or boundary of, but this is really a lovely photo!', '2003-12-24 07:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(521924, 51321, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Captured the winter day - a bit of a stretch on the theme.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Captured the winter day - a bit of a stretch on the theme.', '2003-12-24 07:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(521929, 51899, 13759, '<td valign="top">I like so much of it. Is really wonderful. The colors, shares, the edge of light in the knife, but... the large piece of orange seems to be sliced a day before! It is withered. But the photo´s impact is the same, it´s only a detail!</td>', 'I like so much of it. Is really wonderful. The colors, shares, the edge of light in the knife, but... the large piece of orange seems to be sliced a day before! It is withered. But the photo´s impact is the same, it´s only a detail!', '2003-12-24 07:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(521934, 51728, 13759, '<td valign="top">Wonderful place! I can´t wait to the vonting end to see where it was taken. Nice photo.</td>', 'Wonderful place! I can´t wait to the vonting end to see where it was taken. Nice photo.', '2003-12-24 07:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(521937, 51920, 13759, '<td valign="top">Wow, it really nice. What is that strange thing over the edge? Nice macro too. I like it, you had a great idea!</td>', 'Wow, it really nice. What is that strange thing over the edge? Nice macro too. I like it, you had a great idea!', '2003-12-24 08:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(521938, 51934, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely flawless... 10.</td>', 'this is absolutely flawless... 10.', '2003-12-24 08:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(521943, 51476, 1570, '<td valign="top">to answer your question, it''s "Death After Life"... to rate your picture, it''s 10...</td>', 'to answer your question, it''s "Death After Life"... to rate your picture, it''s 10...', '2003-12-24 08:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(521944, 52040, 13759, '<td valign="top">This is very simple. I dislike it, because of simplicity of photography. It´s a edge, that is right. Only you can play more with the light and angles.</td>', 'This is very simple. I dislike it, because of simplicity of photography. It´s a edge, that is right. Only you can play more with the light and angles.', '2003-12-24 08:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521947, 51520, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good shot! In the edge of death. I found the exposure a bit underexposed and a trouble with subject focus. The snail, is your subject, but its details are not revealed as well as the boot is, by the exposure and focus.</td>', 'Good shot! In the edge of death. I found the exposure a bit underexposed and a trouble with subject focus. The snail, is your subject, but its details are not revealed as well as the boot is, by the exposure and focus.', '2003-12-24 08:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(521950, 51725, 13759, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I thought that this shot don´t show to me any edges.</td>', 'Sorry, but I thought that this shot don´t show to me any edges.', '2003-12-24 08:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(521952, 52081, 14614, '<td valign="top">Creative - something about the pencil not being in focus upsets the composition a little.</td>', 'Creative - something about the pencil not being in focus upsets the composition a little.', '2003-12-24 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(521953, 51810, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the dark forground and the lit background.  Lost a little drama by having the person in the center of the frame.</td>', 'I like the dark forground and the lit background.  Lost a little drama by having the person in the center of the frame.', '2003-12-24 08:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(521955, 52064, 13759, '<td valign="top">Well done! This fit as a glove to the challenge. I had noticed only that the horizon line is wrong, possibly caused by camera inclination due to handheld. You can conpensate it in post shot adjustments in PS.</td>', 'Well done! This fit as a glove to the challenge. I had noticed only that the horizon line is wrong, possibly caused by camera inclination due to handheld. You can conpensate it in post shot adjustments in PS.', '2003-12-24 08:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(521956, 52089, 14614, '<td valign="top">Caught the moment.  Took me a while to spot the glass and since that''s the edge, I would have liked to see it punched up a bit.</td>', 'Caught the moment.  Took me a while to spot the glass and since that''s the edge, I would have liked to see it punched up a bit.', '2003-12-24 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(521957, 52063, 14614, '<td valign="top">Creative play on boarders.  Far right edge seems out of focus but otherwise well done</td>', 'Creative play on boarders.  Far right edge seems out of focus but otherwise well done', '2003-12-24 08:41:46.000000', NULL, 1);
