(522012, 51521, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great idea - person''s too much in the shadows to add the drama the photo needs</td>', 'Great idea - person''s too much in the shadows to add the drama the photo needs', '2003-12-24 09:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(522013, 51991, 15345, '<td valign="top">wow, you can almost feel the moment</td>', 'wow, you can almost feel the moment', '2003-12-24 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(522014, 51686, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s an interesting shot!  I had noticed only some issues with light. Probabilly you had used the internal flash of your camera to do it. Leaving this typical reflexions and geting a bit underexposed picture. Try to use more closed alternative, directable light sources, as table lights or table spots. This allows you to get more light in two or more directions, in some cases eliminating the flash need. Other thing is to remember to bounce or difuse the flash, simply putting a napkin over it.</td>', 'It´s an interesting shot!  I had noticed only some issues with light. Probabilly you had used the internal flash of your camera to do it. Leaving this typical reflexions and geting a bit underexposed picture. Try to use more closed alternative, directable light sources, as table lights or table spots. This allows you to get more light in two or more directions, in some cases eliminating the flash need. Other thing is to remember to bounce or difuse the flash, simply putting a napkin over it.', '2003-12-24 09:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(522015, 51520, 15345, '<td valign="top">so near to death!  Eww</td>', 'so near to death!  Eww', '2003-12-24 09:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(522016, 52010, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great shot - centering the olive (?) makes the photo.</td>', 'Great shot - centering the olive (?) makes the photo.', '2003-12-24 09:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(522017, 51899, 15345, '<td valign="top">maybe this would have been colder with ice next to it.</td>', 'maybe this would have been colder with ice next to it.', '2003-12-24 09:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(522019, 52079, 15345, '<td valign="top">this would have been cool to catch on the point of impact</td>', 'this would have been cool to catch on the point of impact', '2003-12-24 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(522020, 51974, 14614, '<td valign="top">Picture is too small for me to see!</td>', 'Picture is too small for me to see!', '2003-12-24 09:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
