(522061, 51429, 15242, '<td valign="top">Pointing a unloaded gun at me isn''t going to convince me to give a higher score.  Too much of the picture is out of focus and the rainbow border is very distracting.</td>', 'Pointing a unloaded gun at me isn''t going to convince me to give a higher score.  Too much of the picture is out of focus and the rainbow border is very distracting.', '2003-12-24 10:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
