(522064, 51992, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great colors, good capture of action.  It looks like the picture could have been taken at a higher resolution, as some of the edges are chopy.  A little too much may have been cropped also, as the other yellow ski might ad more to the photo.</td>', 'Great colors, good capture of action.  It looks like the picture could have been taken at a higher resolution, as some of the edges are chopy.  A little too much may have been cropped also, as the other yellow ski might ad more to the photo.', '2003-12-24 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(522065, 52106, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great sunset shot, but I don''t see "on the edge."  I see an edge, but nothing is on it.</td>', 'Great sunset shot, but I don''t see "on the edge."  I see an edge, but nothing is on it.', '2003-12-24 10:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(522069, 51877, 13759, '<td valign="top">It seems very pixelited. The texture apear to be taken with high digital tele or the crop was magnified so much. Try to do it with macro mode of your camera.</td>', 'It seems very pixelited. The texture apear to be taken with high digital tele or the crop was magnified so much. Try to do it with macro mode of your camera.', '2003-12-24 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(522074, 51694, 15242, '<td valign="top">Finally a shot that clearly meets the challenge...  Very clear.  If the shot was taken with out the wings spread it''s a very plain shot.  The wings being spread add a lot to this.  Good capture.</td>', 'Finally a shot that clearly meets the challenge...  Very clear.  If the shot was taken with out the wings spread it''s a very plain shot.  The wings being spread add a lot to this.  Good capture.', '2003-12-24 10:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
