(522150, 51987, 6804, '<td valign="top">Awesome work! A brilliant piece of art for this contest topic.<br/>1 - On the edge of darkness to light.<br/>2 - from restriction to inviting<br/>3 - Pain to pleasure<br/>I like the title and how it relates to the image in my mind, but I think quite differently.<br/>I love this shot, but i think some might not see the connections it has to "Borders" because it''s subtle. Perhaps too subtle for flash voters that fly on bye without taking time to think about the depth. I''m giving it a 9.  If the gray-light area were a little more even, it would have pulled a 10 from me.</td>', 'Awesome work! A brilliant piece of art for this contest topic.1 - On the edge of darkness to light.2 - from restriction to inviting3 - Pain to pleasureI like the title and how it relates to the image in my mind, but I think quite differently.I love this shot, but i think some might not see the connections it has to "Borders" because it''s subtle. Perhaps too subtle for flash voters that fly on bye without taking time to think about the depth. I''m giving it a 9.  If the gray-light area were a little more even, it would have pulled a 10 from me.', '2003-12-24 11:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
