(523027, 51437, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent catch and well captured!  The bit of noise in the sky is a little distracting given this is almost pure two toned.  Perhaps this would be good to run through NeatImage.</td>', 'Excellent catch and well captured!  The bit of noise in the sky is a little distracting given this is almost pure two toned.  Perhaps this would be good to run through NeatImage.', '2003-12-25 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
