(523115, 51574, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice tone of color used here. Horizon is tilted though.</td>', 'Nice tone of color used here. Horizon is tilted though.', '2003-12-26 02:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(523116, 52103, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little off.  looks like direct flash was used, judging by the flare on the grey bible.  try using a diffuser or bounced flash to soften it up.  nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'the lighting is a little off.  looks like direct flash was used, judging by the flare on the grey bible.  try using a diffuser or bounced flash to soften it up.  nice take on the challenge.', '2003-12-26 03:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(523117, 51321, 12160, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2003-12-26 03:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(523118, 51928, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like the thought here - somehow the wee image of the guy on the bridge has some emotion, and not just cuz he''s on  a bridge.  His posture or something must be doing it. not sure, but i like it.</td>', 'i like the thought here - somehow the wee image of the guy on the bridge has some emotion, and not just cuz he''s on  a bridge.  His posture or something must be doing it. not sure, but i like it.', '2003-12-26 03:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(523119, 52079, 6388, '<td valign="top">the colour is a bit odd...either your software did it (maybe on purpose) or you might need to adjust your white balance a little.  focus is pretty good, lighting seems good.  nice job. Pedro</td>', 'the colour is a bit odd...either your software did it (maybe on purpose) or you might need to adjust your white balance a little.  focus is pretty good, lighting seems good.  nice job. Pedro', '2003-12-26 03:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(523120, 52065, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and sharpness. This photo is too busy for my taste.</td>', 'Nice colors and sharpness. This photo is too busy for my taste.', '2003-12-26 03:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(523122, 51780, 6388, '<td valign="top">i just saw cirque in t San Francisco last week. nice job...these are really hard to catch because of the stage lights.  she''s a little blown out in parts, but i really like the hint of the orchestra on the left.  this pic works nicely.</td>', 'i just saw cirque in t San Francisco last week. nice job...these are really hard to catch because of the stage lights.  she''s a little blown out in parts, but i really like the hint of the orchestra on the left.  this pic works nicely.', '2003-12-26 03:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(523123, 52010, 4090, '<td valign="top">A bit noise''s - but otherwise a great idea and well shot... 9/10</td>', 'A bit noise''s - but otherwise a great idea and well shot... 9/10', '2003-12-26 03:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(523124, 51854, 12160, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It''s beautiful.</td>', 'I love this shot. It''s beautiful.', '2003-12-26 03:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(523125, 51883, 6388, '<td valign="top">someone else with a canadian coin...i like it :)  the shadow is a little odd...harsh or something.  i newer nickle would have been easier to light...less funny shadows etc.  nice pic.  Pedro</td>', 'someone else with a canadian coin...i like it :)  the shadow is a little odd...harsh or something.  i newer nickle would have been easier to light...less funny shadows etc.  nice pic.  Pedro', '2003-12-26 03:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523126, 52012, 4090, '<td valign="top">sorry this is a bit out of focus</td>', 'sorry this is a bit out of focus', '2003-12-26 03:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(523127, 52057, 6388, '<td valign="top">i prefer my GT''s with a slice of orange.  nice pic - great lighting, nice choice of beverage.  Pedro</td>', 'i prefer my GT''s with a slice of orange.  nice pic - great lighting, nice choice of beverage.  Pedro', '2003-12-26 03:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(523128, 51838, 6388, '<td valign="top">one of my fav''s so far.  the glow makes the shot, and easiely overshadows the blown out part of the buildings.  very well done. Pedro</td>', 'one of my fav''s so far.  the glow makes the shot, and easiely overshadows the blown out part of the buildings.  very well done. Pedro', '2003-12-26 03:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(523129, 51415, 4090, '<td valign="top">not keen on the frame but the photo is great 8/10</td>', 'not keen on the frame but the photo is great 8/10', '2003-12-26 03:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(523130, 51540, 4090, '<td valign="top">really well done 10/10</td>', 'really well done 10/10', '2003-12-26 03:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(523136, 51882, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much. I think it could be a little higher quality, but it is amazing to get a shot like this, so you don\''t have much oppurtunity to pick and choose location, and set up the camera. The title is a cliche but gives a good sense. It could have easily been called on the edge of falling, but that is probably what the viewers are thinking so you don\''t need that title. I like this originality. 9</td>', 'I like this shot very much. I think it could be a little higher quality, but it is amazing to get a shot like this, so you don\''t have much oppurtunity to pick and choose location, and set up the camera. The title is a cliche but gives a good sense. It could have easily been called on the edge of falling, but that is probably what the viewers are thinking so you don\''t need that title. I like this originality. 9', '2003-12-26 03:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(523139, 51730, 15199, '<td valign="top">Interesting Perspective, not strongly portraying the edge but nice.</td>', 'Interesting Perspective, not strongly portraying the edge but nice.', '2003-12-26 03:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(523141, 51505, 15199, '<td valign="top">Picture is not very clear, still confused where the focus is. There are edges on the photo, yet the edge is not very strongly portrayed</td>', 'Picture is not very clear, still confused where the focus is. There are edges on the photo, yet the edge is not very strongly portrayed', '2003-12-26 03:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(523143, 51432, 15199, '<td valign="top">Did mouse survive the ordeal? Good concept, maybe better if the trap was still raised about to fall. Nice composition.</td>', 'Did mouse survive the ordeal? Good concept, maybe better if the trap was still raised about to fall. Nice composition.', '2003-12-26 03:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(523147, 51651, 10222, '<td valign="top">Excellent job. I love the colours in this image. 9</td>', 'Excellent job. I love the colours in this image. 9', '2003-12-26 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(523148, 51429, 15199, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective, not sure about the border though. The soft bedding to the gun does soften the harshness of the weapon though. Nice colors.</td>', 'Excellent perspective, not sure about the border though. The soft bedding to the gun does soften the harshness of the weapon though. Nice colors.', '2003-12-26 04:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(523149, 52114, 15199, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed with all the white in the sky. You do lose some details in the metal texture. The focus point is a bit distracting.</td>', 'A bit overexposed with all the white in the sky. You do lose some details in the metal texture. The focus point is a bit distracting.', '2003-12-26 04:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(523151, 51585, 15199, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I beleive it fails to emphasize the border itself.. Maybe a gate closing the entrace would have made more impact.</td>', 'Nice composition, I beleive it fails to emphasize the border itself.. Maybe a gate closing the entrace would have made more impact.', '2003-12-26 04:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(523152, 52064, 15199, '<td valign="top">Interesting, unfortunetaly the idea of the borders does not come out very strongly.</td>', 'Interesting, unfortunetaly the idea of the borders does not come out very strongly.', '2003-12-26 04:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(523153, 51375, 15199, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, being closer the the walkway end would have given it that mode of an edge. Love the way the lines in the picture are composed.</td>', 'Very nice colors, being closer the the walkway end would have given it that mode of an edge. Love the way the lines in the picture are composed.', '2003-12-26 04:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(523154, 51882, 15199, '<td valign="top">The sense of vertigo is being distracted by the two light beams, artificial on top right and sunlinght bottom left. Nice idea though. I think the diagonal would have been nicer if it cut the picture in two.</td>', 'The sense of vertigo is being distracted by the two light beams, artificial on top right and sunlinght bottom left. Nice idea though. I think the diagonal would have been nicer if it cut the picture in two.', '2003-12-26 04:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(523155, 52046, 15199, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, maybe if the writing was not there, it would have been more nicely composed.</td>', 'Interesting concept, maybe if the writing was not there, it would have been more nicely composed.', '2003-12-26 04:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(523158, 51977, 10170, '<td valign="top">I didn''t spot the girl there first time around, but when I did it cleared up the meaning behind the photo.  Sad though :(<br/></td>', 'I didn''t spot the girl there first time around, but when I did it cleared up the meaning behind the photo.  Sad though :(', '2003-12-26 06:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
