(523162, 52059, 3306, '<td valign="top">beautifully crisp and colorful. I like the setup and angle of the subject.</td>', 'beautifully crisp and colorful. I like the setup and angle of the subject.', '2003-12-26 08:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
