(523242, 52108, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, I like the right skate being on the edge especially! I would like to see this one bigger and graininess could be reduced with NeatImage, I also suggest not to use digital zoom at all: good for nothing, you can get the same result by cropping a bigger photo. Background on the top of the image has blowed out, too... Keep on trying, this idea could be improved to a good shot.</td>', 'Very good idea, I like the right skate being on the edge especially! I would like to see this one bigger and graininess could be reduced with NeatImage, I also suggest not to use digital zoom at all: good for nothing, you can get the same result by cropping a bigger photo. Background on the top of the image has blowed out, too... Keep on trying, this idea could be improved to a good shot.', '2003-12-26 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(523243, 51906, 10546, '<td valign="top">Dsiturbing. Like it!</td>', 'Dsiturbing. Like it!', '2003-12-26 10:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
