(523248, 52072, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2003-12-26 10:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(523249, 52118, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal composition, anyway it could be sharper, this way it''s a bit blurry. Maybe I would have more "divided" apart" feeling if you had added some subjects to the both sides, just an idea and matter of personal taste.</td>', 'I like the diagonal composition, anyway it could be sharper, this way it''s a bit blurry. Maybe I would have more "divided" apart" feeling if you had added some subjects to the both sides, just an idea and matter of personal taste.', '2003-12-26 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(523252, 52012, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good idea, makes me think about it in a literal way, too. The scratch on the edge of the table(?) is a bit distracting and background is busy for my personal taste, too (removing the objects or shallower DOF would have helped, I think so). The ash-tray could be sharper, too, though the composition of it is good!</td>', 'Good idea, makes me think about it in a literal way, too. The scratch on the edge of the table(?) is a bit distracting and background is busy for my personal taste, too (removing the objects or shallower DOF would have helped, I think so). The ash-tray could be sharper, too, though the composition of it is good!', '2003-12-26 10:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(523255, 52091, 10858, '<td valign="top">Is it on the edge of falling into the river? Very creative idea, I also love the silouettes and the background having a foggy feeling, and a wonderful nature photo! White border is not even on the sides, it''s narrower on the right. Take 9 from me.</td>', 'Is it on the edge of falling into the river? Very creative idea, I also love the silouettes and the background having a foggy feeling, and a wonderful nature photo! White border is not even on the sides, it''s narrower on the right. Take 9 from me.', '2003-12-26 10:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
