(523262, 51512, 10858, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and composition, I like the skate slipping on the edge, and your original title fits the challenge, too! Left side of the skate metal could be more in focus, maybe crop is too tight on the left. I am hesitating between 8 and 9, but I love the idea and all so much that I give you the 9. :-) Happy Holidays and photograph a lot. :-)</td>', 'Excellent idea and composition, I like the skate slipping on the edge, and your original title fits the challenge, too! Left side of the skate metal could be more in focus, maybe crop is too tight on the left. I am hesitating between 8 and 9, but I love the idea and all so much that I give you the 9. :-) Happy Holidays and photograph a lot. :-)', '2003-12-26 11:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(523274, 51521, 14813, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what''s going on here...</td>', 'Can''t really tell what''s going on here...', '2003-12-26 11:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(523280, 51468, 6097, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I like the arch and how the stream still continues back into the shadow but is still somewhat well exposed.  Perhaps just a little to sharp but not so much that it takes anything away from the shot.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I like the arch and how the stream still continues back into the shadow but is still somewhat well exposed.  Perhaps just a little to sharp but not so much that it takes anything away from the shot.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-12-26 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(523281, 51873, 6097, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative.  I like the high tech feel of this shot.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting and creative.  I like the high tech feel of this shot.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-12-26 11:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523282, 51694, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like how you got the shot with the wings expanded.  And yes, he is on the edge.  :-)  Good exposure although maybe just a big blown out on the tail.  Not much you can do with that though within the rules.  Very nice!  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like how you got the shot with the wings expanded.  And yes, he is on the edge.  :-)  Good exposure although maybe just a big blown out on the tail.  Not much you can do with that though within the rules.  Very nice!  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-12-26 11:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(523283, 52099, 10858, '<td valign="top">The photo is grainy and the wide white border on the right and bottom are very distracting. The lighting on the metal is good! No blow outs anywhere.</td>', 'The photo is grainy and the wide white border on the right and bottom are very distracting. The lighting on the metal is good! No blow outs anywhere.', '2003-12-26 11:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(523284, 51497, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good idea, on the edge of keeping or giving it to charity! :-) I would have used a homogenic dark background and money could be a bit more in focus, otherwise I like the unique idea here.</td>', 'Good idea, on the edge of keeping or giving it to charity! :-) I would have used a homogenic dark background and money could be a bit more in focus, otherwise I like the unique idea here.', '2003-12-26 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
