(523346, 52037, 10858, '<td valign="top">The snake could have more accent here and I would have chosen a more homogenic background, otherwise the idea is one of my favourites in this challenge! Take 8 from me.</td>', 'The snake could have more accent here and I would have chosen a more homogenic background, otherwise the idea is one of my favourites in this challenge! Take 8 from me.', '2003-12-26 14:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
