(523410, 52051, 10858, '<td valign="top">The thing on the bottom is a bit distracting, the sky has a strange colour and really looks as it was made with a digital zoom... just never use digital zooms, they are good for nothing. Same effect, if you crop and enlarge a photo. The idea is good, and the fall colours are great. :-)</td>', 'The thing on the bottom is a bit distracting, the sky has a strange colour and really looks as it was made with a digital zoom... just never use digital zooms, they are good for nothing. Same effect, if you crop and enlarge a photo. The idea is good, and the fall colours are great. :-)', '2003-12-26 16:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
