(523412, 51505, 10858, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for me, and could be a bit sharper. The idea is very good. :-) The water just makes me a serious border if I want to get to the house.</td>', 'A bit too dark for me, and could be a bit sharper. The idea is very good. :-) The water just makes me a serious border if I want to get to the house.', '2003-12-26 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
