(523567, 52089, 14001, '<td valign="top">Why is it brown?  Does that have some meaning?  I guess I don''t understand the story.  7.</td>', 'Why is it brown?  Does that have some meaning?  I guess I don''t understand the story.  7.', '2003-12-26 22:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(523568, 52107, 5822, '<td valign="top">You are not letting us see the beauty of these surroundings by blocking a good part of the image with the dark post on the left or the out of focus ice on top of it. The post does not show any interesting detail or color and so to my eye, does not add any value to the picture. In addition, you''ve lost detail in the snow and in parts of the background trees.  I think the contrast is way too high here. Also, the line you''ve created with the edge of the fense leads to a puny, and insignificant tree. <br/> <br/>I hope you didn''t find my critique too harsh, but rather, constructive.</td>', 'You are not letting us see the beauty of these surroundings by blocking a good part of the image with the dark post on the left or the out of focus ice on top of it. The post does not show any interesting detail or color and so to my eye, does not add any value to the picture. In addition, you''ve lost detail in the snow and in parts of the background trees.  I think the contrast is way too high here. Also, the line you''ve created with the edge of the fense leads to a puny, and insignificant tree.  I hope you didn''t find my critique too harsh, but rather, constructive.', '2003-12-26 22:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
