(523589, 51911, 13313, '<td valign="top">Only the title has any bearing on the challenge.</td>', 'Only the title has any bearing on the challenge.', '2003-12-26 22:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(523591, 51780, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish you had zoomed in on this performer and used a portrait format.  The subjects are too smalll and the surroundings are so dark that it doesn\''t matter that you\''ve included the setting as you can\''t see it. In addition, the trapeze artist is mostly in shadow and so barely visible. Perhaps different expousre settings would have improved this picture. The performer also appears out of focus, probably do to subject mvement. I do, however,  like very much the concept of this picture. The woman hanging suspended by a long red sash, along with the dramatic lighting could make for a very compelling picture.</td>', 'I wish you had zoomed in on this performer and used a portrait format.  The subjects are too smalll and the surroundings are so dark that it doesn\''t matter that you\''ve included the setting as you can\''t see it. In addition, the trapeze artist is mostly in shadow and so barely visible. Perhaps different expousre settings would have improved this picture. The performer also appears out of focus, probably do to subject mvement. I do, however,  like very much the concept of this picture. The woman hanging suspended by a long red sash, along with the dramatic lighting could make for a very compelling picture.', '2003-12-26 22:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(523601, 51854, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured though a plane''s window! I love the color contrast and the way the clounds float.</td>', 'Beautifully captured though a plane''s window! I love the color contrast and the way the clounds float.', '2003-12-27 00:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(523602, 51991, 5822, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and very gut wrenching scene that few photos on DPC have been able to accomplish for me. You\''ve captured the conflict and anguish of a person in this dilemna very well.  I especially like the tones and bleak and barren setting in this tudor style room/house. It almost gives the impression of being in a dungeon or torture chamber, which, metaphorically speaking this person appears to be in.  <br/> <br/>Another effect I like very much is the constrained, hemmed-in feeling in this picture due to the, albeit, slanted walls and border and long portrait format, which leads to the "no way out" feeling. Though the light from the window is way too harsh and blown out, it giives the impression of life outside weighing too heavily on this person.  The harsh light also gives a slight haze or film to the shot, which in this instance I like. <br/> <br/>It\''s too bad that the electrical cabling shows on the ceiling, which I find distracting, as well as, some unknown object in the upper left hand corner. Other than that, very well done. Great job.</td>', 'Dramatic and very gut wrenching scene that few photos on DPC have been able to accomplish for me. You\''ve captured the conflict and anguish of a person in this dilemna very well.  I especially like the tones and bleak and barren setting in this tudor style room/house. It almost gives the impression of being in a dungeon or torture chamber, which, metaphorically speaking this person appears to be in.   Another effect I like very much is the constrained, hemmed-in feeling in this picture due to the, albeit, slanted walls and border and long portrait format, which leads to the "no way out" feeling. Though the light from the window is way too harsh and blown out, it giives the impression of life outside weighing too heavily on this person.  The harsh light also gives a slight haze or film to the shot, which in this instance I like.  It\''s too bad that the electrical cabling shows on the ceiling, which I find distracting, as well as, some unknown object in the upper left hand corner. Other than that, very well done. Great job.', '2003-12-27 00:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(523604, 51755, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I especially like the colors and the lighting.  I think this picture meets the challenge better than any picture I have seen in the challenge as it shows the transition from still water to turbulence, by way of the waterfall (which, I might add was very well captured !)  The tree in the foreground is quite bothersome and distracting though.  Too bad you didn\''t, or couldn\''t, take another vantage point.  Nevertheless, very well done.  Did I say how much I love how you cpatured the waterfall? :)</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I especially like the colors and the lighting.  I think this picture meets the challenge better than any picture I have seen in the challenge as it shows the transition from still water to turbulence, by way of the waterfall (which, I might add was very well captured !)  The tree in the foreground is quite bothersome and distracting though.  Too bad you didn\''t, or couldn\''t, take another vantage point.  Nevertheless, very well done.  Did I say how much I love how you cpatured the waterfall? :)', '2003-12-27 00:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(523614, 52071, 2792, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  This immediately stood out for me.  The concept is just wonderful, having the split personality.  Only one complaint...the shadows under both her eyes kinda bother me.  I can see where it would work for the "punk" half, but I think that the right eye (her left) should be better lit to go with her bright shirt.  My favorite, 10.</td>', 'Fantastic!  This immediately stood out for me.  The concept is just wonderful, having the split personality.  Only one complaint...the shadows under both her eyes kinda bother me.  I can see where it would work for the "punk" half, but I think that the right eye (her left) should be better lit to go with her bright shirt.  My favorite, 10.', '2003-12-27 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(523616, 52100, 2792, '<td valign="top">Like that the car looks like it is going to leave the frame, just wish it was cropped that close in the bottom right hand corner (nice to see just a hair more space).  Love the scenery.  Also, I wonder if this would have looked better in color?  Otherwise, nice job.  7</td>', 'Like that the car looks like it is going to leave the frame, just wish it was cropped that close in the bottom right hand corner (nice to see just a hair more space).  Love the scenery.  Also, I wonder if this would have looked better in color?  Otherwise, nice job.  7', '2003-12-27 00:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(523617, 51429, 2792, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  Unfortunately, IMHO, the border really detracts from the picture.  It just doesn''t fit for me, sorry.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  Unfortunately, IMHO, the border really detracts from the picture.  It just doesn''t fit for me, sorry.', '2003-12-27 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(523621, 51943, 11184, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people want to comment on this one  but are too uncomfortable or scared $hi+less to say anything?  Incredibly disturbing shot, but I figure any photo that is able to be as disturbing as this is must be pretty damn good too.</td>', 'I wonder how many people want to comment on this one  but are too uncomfortable or scared $hi+less to say anything?  Incredibly disturbing shot, but I figure any photo that is able to be as disturbing as this is must be pretty damn good too.', '2003-12-27 00:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(523632, 51810, 5822, '<td valign="top">The use of silhouettes against blue sky to make your subjects stand out is very good, and the inclusion of just enough background mountain range in the lower left gives scale and perspective as importan clues. The only thing I don''t like is the centrally located placed person which gives a static feel to the photo. Maybe placing him/her up higher in the photo would have added a more dynamic feel.  Overall, well done.</td>', 'The use of silhouettes against blue sky to make your subjects stand out is very good, and the inclusion of just enough background mountain range in the lower left gives scale and perspective as importan clues. The only thing I don''t like is the centrally located placed person which gives a static feel to the photo. Maybe placing him/her up higher in the photo would have added a more dynamic feel.  Overall, well done.', '2003-12-27 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(523635, 52031, 10111, '<td valign="top">i think this would be more effective in a very contrasty black and white.</td>', 'i think this would be more effective in a very contrasty black and white.', '2003-12-27 01:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(523637, 51540, 14317, '<td valign="top">Very striking, and bold image!  This photo really comes out at you.  It makes the viewer wonder who is behind the hand on the left, and it forces One to focus on the model''s lens for the answer.  But alas, we have to look hard......or so do we think, for that hand may well be our own?  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very striking, and bold image!  This photo really comes out at you.  It makes the viewer wonder who is behind the hand on the left, and it forces One to focus on the model''s lens for the answer.  But alas, we have to look hard......or so do we think, for that hand may well be our own?  Nicely done.', '2003-12-27 02:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523638, 52099, 13136, '<td valign="top">The cropping looks like you made a mistake. The graininess and low light do not work for me.</td>', 'The cropping looks like you made a mistake. The graininess and low light do not work for me.', '2003-12-27 02:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(523639, 51974, 15199, '<td valign="top">The photo is quite small making it difficult to discern details. Next time make it larger then store with less than maximum jpeg compression.</td>', 'The photo is quite small making it difficult to discern details. Next time make it larger then store with less than maximum jpeg compression.', '2003-12-27 02:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(523640, 51552, 15199, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, only drawback is the camouflage effect of the top bug. If only it stood out more through difference in color. Great shadows and perfect composition.</td>', 'Awesome shot, only drawback is the camouflage effect of the top bug. If only it stood out more through difference in color. Great shadows and perfect composition.', '2003-12-27 02:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(523641, 51661, 15199, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea. Great shot.</td>', 'Awesome idea. Great shot.', '2003-12-27 02:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(523642, 51928, 15199, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. Maybe if the person stood out more it would have been more effective, say with more pronounced clothes or through a shot from below at wide angle.</td>', 'Very good idea. Maybe if the person stood out more it would have been more effective, say with more pronounced clothes or through a shot from below at wide angle.', '2003-12-27 02:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(523647, 51987, 10419, '<td valign="top">Although there are many nice images in this challenge, this one speaks to me on a personal level.  The message is very powerful. It fits the challenge very well as it shows the boundary between two very different worlds. <br/> <br/>I like the way you composed it, the way the darker side is behind the lights and the lighter side behind the wire. I think this could have been even better in b&amp;w, but no points taken off for colour. You get full marks form me.</td>', 'Although there are many nice images in this challenge, this one speaks to me on a personal level.  The message is very powerful. It fits the challenge very well as it shows the boundary between two very different worlds.  I like the way you composed it, the way the darker side is behind the lights and the lighter side behind the wire. I think this could have been even better in b&w, but no points taken off for colour. You get full marks form me.', '2003-12-27 04:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(523649, 51540, 5158, '<td valign="top">Woow! My favorit this week! Very strong very surreal and fits very good to the challenge topic.<br/>Technically very well done: sharp, well cropped and B&amp;W works great. Also the background is well chosen.<br/>Acctually I can''t tell for sure if you used a mirror or if there are two persons. <br/>I like the man''s (your!?) neutral expression and the sun-glasses: adds well to the surreal feeling.<br/>For me the winner, hopefully for others too (10)</td>', 'Woow! My favorit this week! Very strong very surreal and fits very good to the challenge topic.Technically very well done: sharp, well cropped and B&W works great. Also the background is well chosen.Acctually I can''t tell for sure if you used a mirror or if there are two persons. I like the man''s (your!?) neutral expression and the sun-glasses: adds well to the surreal feeling.For me the winner, hopefully for others too (10)', '2003-12-27 05:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(523650, 51728, 5158, '<td valign="top">Where the hell is that?! On the mars. <br/>It''s a wonderfull surreal landscape you captured and the pale colors adds well to the mood of the scenery. Too sad that there were the clouds comming in on the left side.<br/>I''m not sure if it fits the challenge well: the title is needed to get your intention. <br/>However, if I would have been you I would have submitted that image too. <br/>Good luck for you (9).</td>', 'Where the hell is that?! On the mars. It''s a wonderfull surreal landscape you captured and the pale colors adds well to the mood of the scenery. Too sad that there were the clouds comming in on the left side.I''m not sure if it fits the challenge well: the title is needed to get your intention. However, if I would have been you I would have submitted that image too. Good luck for you (9).', '2003-12-27 05:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523651, 51854, 5158, '<td valign="top">Many in-flight images have been shown here on DPC, but this one stands out for its great clarity and contrast. Also the wonderfull low clouds makes it a great photo.<br/>Also it fits the challenge well. <br/>Good luck to you (9)</td>', 'Many in-flight images have been shown here on DPC, but this one stands out for its great clarity and contrast. Also the wonderfull low clouds makes it a great photo.Also it fits the challenge well. Good luck to you (9)', '2003-12-27 05:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(523653, 52036, 5158, '<td valign="top">While I like the idea of this image, I have to say that its been rather poor executed: these kind of abstract images have to be on a very high quality to work well here and get high votes. So jpeg-artifacts must be avoided and the light has to be set very well. <br/>It took me some time to realize that the egg is at an edge: the background-color and the table color are to simillar.</td>', 'While I like the idea of this image, I have to say that its been rather poor executed: these kind of abstract images have to be on a very high quality to work well here and get high votes. So jpeg-artifacts must be avoided and the light has to be set very well. It took me some time to realize that the egg is at an edge: the background-color and the table color are to simillar.', '2003-12-27 05:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(523660, 52065, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and a lovely scene.</td>', 'Beautiful color and a lovely scene.', '2003-12-27 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(523661, 52107, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice composition, but I''d like to see more detail in the metal and wood textures. Perhaps somewhat less contrast might improve it, or shooting at a time when the light is stronger and from the right-hand side.</td>', 'A nice composition, but I''d like to see more detail in the metal and wood textures. Perhaps somewhat less contrast might improve it, or shooting at a time when the light is stronger and from the right-hand side.', '2003-12-27 09:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(523662, 52106, 12733, '<td valign="top">That''s a gorgeous sky. The electric utility pole (I asume that''s what it is) becomes a religious symbol (a modern Stonehenge) in this setting. Great shot.</td>', 'That''s a gorgeous sky. The electric utility pole (I asume that''s what it is) becomes a religious symbol (a modern Stonehenge) in this setting. Great shot.', '2003-12-27 09:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(523663, 52057, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup, color and reflections. A great still life shot.</td>', 'Nice closeup, color and reflections. A great still life shot.', '2003-12-27 09:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(523664, 52086, 12733, '<td valign="top">If I''m reading the message right, this is a very chilling notion - that medication of some sort is what maintains (or ends?) life. Photographically, the picture is kind of flat, and the lines within the bottle tops seem to be significant, but leave the viewer wondering why.</td>', 'If I''m reading the message right, this is a very chilling notion - that medication of some sort is what maintains (or ends?) life. Photographically, the picture is kind of flat, and the lines within the bottle tops seem to be significant, but leave the viewer wondering why.', '2003-12-27 09:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523665, 52071, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, and nicely photographed.</td>', 'Interesting concept, and nicely photographed.', '2003-12-27 09:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(523667, 51872, 12733, '<td valign="top">The color of the gas flame is great, and the transparency comes through in this photo. The thermometer adds a nice touch. This shot shows that sometimes breaking the rules (don''t center the subject) makes a better composition.</td>', 'The color of the gas flame is great, and the transparency comes through in this photo. The thermometer adds a nice touch. This shot shows that sometimes breaking the rules (don''t center the subject) makes a better composition.', '2003-12-27 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(523668, 52082, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nicely conceived, lighted and composed.</td>', 'Nicely conceived, lighted and composed.', '2003-12-27 09:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(523669, 52012, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the visual pun, but as a photograph this is too messy and not well lighted. The focus should be on the cigarettes. I would guess that some thought went into placement of the objects, but what comes across is a casual snapshot.</td>', 'I like the visual pun, but as a photograph this is too messy and not well lighted. The focus should be on the cigarettes. I would guess that some thought went into placement of the objects, but what comes across is a casual snapshot.', '2003-12-27 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(523670, 51913, 12733, '<td valign="top">One of the things that can make or break a sunset is the foreground. You''ve captured an interesting line of buildings in silhouette and great reflections. The only disturbing thing is the dead-center horizon, which leaves too much black at the bottom. Possibly cropping away some of the right-hand portion would improve the composition.</td>', 'One of the things that can make or break a sunset is the foreground. You''ve captured an interesting line of buildings in silhouette and great reflections. The only disturbing thing is the dead-center horizon, which leaves too much black at the bottom. Possibly cropping away some of the right-hand portion would improve the composition.', '2003-12-27 09:36:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(523672, 51892, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice compositional details - the boat, the bird flying overhead. The rock, which both seems to be in the act of falling and is so different in color and texture from the other rocks in the picture, is a distraction.</td>', 'Nice compositional details - the boat, the bird flying overhead. The rock, which both seems to be in the act of falling and is so different in color and texture from the other rocks in the picture, is a distraction.', '2003-12-27 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(523673, 51986, 12733, '<td valign="top">This sign has some interesting texture, but the hot spot at the top and the too-dark bottom tends to make the picture kind f bland.</td>', 'This sign has some interesting texture, but the hot spot at the top and the too-dark bottom tends to make the picture kind f bland.', '2003-12-27 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(523674, 52112, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of silhouettes against an interesting color of sky and water.</td>', 'Nice use of silhouettes against an interesting color of sky and water.', '2003-12-27 09:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(523675, 51642, 11895, '<td valign="top">technically well done and fits the theme but seems to lack imagination, cropped to close on the right, IMHO this could rightly be called a stock photo</td>', 'technically well done and fits the theme but seems to lack imagination, cropped to close on the right, IMHO this could rightly be called a stock photo', '2003-12-27 09:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(523676, 51699, 12733, '<td valign="top">Not a bad party snapshot, but it needs more care in composition and lighting to make it more than that.</td>', 'Not a bad party snapshot, but it needs more care in composition and lighting to make it more than that.', '2003-12-27 09:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(523677, 51854, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the theme of the challenge and is technically well done but lacks imagination, IMHO this could be considered a "stock" photo</td>', 'fits the theme of the challenge and is technically well done but lacks imagination, IMHO this could be considered a "stock" photo', '2003-12-27 09:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(523678, 51704, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures. The angle of the fence, directly across the front of the picture, seems a bit static.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures. The angle of the fence, directly across the front of the picture, seems a bit static.', '2003-12-27 09:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(523679, 51880, 12733, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the challenge, and the exposure and lighting are great. But a match balanced on a razor blade just doesn''t move me as a photograph.</td>', 'This certainly meets the challenge, and the exposure and lighting are great. But a match balanced on a razor blade just doesn''t move me as a photograph.', '2003-12-27 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(523680, 52074, 12733, '<td valign="top">This makes an interesting abstract, while the one clear and sharp section - the edge of the platter - illustrates the challenge well. Nice shot.</td>', 'This makes an interesting abstract, while the one clear and sharp section - the edge of the platter - illustrates the challenge well. Nice shot.', '2003-12-27 09:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(523681, 51908, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very pretty study in the textures of the rocks and pebbles.</td>', 'A very pretty study in the textures of the rocks and pebbles.', '2003-12-27 09:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(523682, 51639, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice study in lighting and its effect on color, but the subject doesn''t have enough inherent interest to hold my attention.</td>', 'A nice study in lighting and its effect on color, but the subject doesn''t have enough inherent interest to hold my attention.', '2003-12-27 09:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(523683, 51388, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures, colors, lighting and composition. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful textures, colors, lighting and composition. Great shot.', '2003-12-27 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(523687, 52072, 11895, '<td valign="top">excellent photo that fits the challenge well</td>', 'excellent photo that fits the challenge well', '2003-12-27 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(523688, 51585, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this and have scored it high but the sky is a bit grainy and it looks a bit oversharpened to me</td>', 'I really like this and have scored it high but the sky is a bit grainy and it looks a bit oversharpened to me', '2003-12-27 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(523689, 51321, 11895, '<td valign="top">might have looked a bit better if you had backed up a bit to get the tree which casts the shadow from the lower left into the picture, <br/>lighting and colors are very pleasing <br/>could be used on a greeting card</td>', 'might have looked a bit better if you had backed up a bit to get the tree which casts the shadow from the lower left into the picture, lighting and colors are very pleasing could be used on a greeting card', '2003-12-27 10:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(523690, 51772, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the topic well, excellent DoF</td>', 'fits the topic well, excellent DoF', '2003-12-27 10:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(523692, 52098, 12733, '<td valign="top">The angle gives this picture a dynamic quality, and the clouds are great.</td>', 'The angle gives this picture a dynamic quality, and the clouds are great.', '2003-12-27 10:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(523693, 51340, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on the metallic luster and reflections. Shooting at an angle adds some dramatic quality to a ho-hum subject.</td>', 'Nice capture on the metallic luster and reflections. Shooting at an angle adds some dramatic quality to a ho-hum subject.', '2003-12-27 10:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(523694, 52108, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, and a good capture of action. The puck would have made this a super shot.</td>', 'Nice concept, and a good capture of action. The puck would have made this a super shot.', '2003-12-27 10:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(523696, 52105, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a nice winter scene. I like the effect of the bare trees in the foreground, and the viaduct adds a nice shape and a border between the bare trees and the evergreens and snow.</td>', 'This is a nice winter scene. I like the effect of the bare trees in the foreground, and the viaduct adds a nice shape and a border between the bare trees and the evergreens and snow.', '2003-12-27 10:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(523697, 52011, 11895, '<td valign="top">needs more color</td>', 'needs more color', '2003-12-27 10:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(523699, 51512, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the variety of textures and materials in this picture.</td>', 'Nice capture of the variety of textures and materials in this picture.', '2003-12-27 10:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(523701, 51505, 11895, '<td valign="top">good idea but too dark</td>', 'good idea but too dark', '2003-12-27 10:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(523703, 52092, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is shot fram an interesting angle, and it creates visually exciting photo. The title is chilling - why does this represent an edge of sanity? Is the contemplation of jumping the only reason someone might enjoy the view from the edge of a roof?</td>', 'This is shot fram an interesting angle, and it creates visually exciting photo. The title is chilling - why does this represent an edge of sanity? Is the contemplation of jumping the only reason someone might enjoy the view from the edge of a roof?', '2003-12-27 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(523705, 52124, 11895, '<td valign="top">too much border, sharper focus on the gravestone would have helped</td>', 'too much border, sharper focus on the gravestone would have helped', '2003-12-27 10:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(523706, 51953, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow, great lighting and close up.</td>', 'Wow, great lighting and close up.', '2003-12-27 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523708, 51337, 12733, '<td valign="top">A pretty corridor, and a nice rendition of the colors and textures that make it up. A human figure near the far end would make it perfect!</td>', 'A pretty corridor, and a nice rendition of the colors and textures that make it up. A human figure near the far end would make it perfect!', '2003-12-27 10:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523709, 51878, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting color variation between the hands draws attention to the closer hand. Would have been a bit better if you could have had the entire closer hand in focus. Good job though.</td>', 'Interesting color variation between the hands draws attention to the closer hand. Would have been a bit better if you could have had the entire closer hand in focus. Good job though.', '2003-12-27 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(523712, 51502, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Looks like he is just ready to fall off the edge.</td>', 'Nice capture. Looks like he is just ready to fall off the edge.', '2003-12-27 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(523713, 51991, 12733, '<td valign="top">This picture offers many possible interpretations, all of them depressing. It is well composed and exposed, and I especially like the sun caught in the corner of the window. A ray of hope, perhaps?</td>', 'This picture offers many possible interpretations, all of them depressing. It is well composed and exposed, and I especially like the sun caught in the corner of the window. A ray of hope, perhaps?', '2003-12-27 10:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(523714, 52035, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great texture and lighting. Interesting to look at.</td>', 'Great texture and lighting. Interesting to look at.', '2003-12-27 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(523715, 51340, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good idea just a little out of focus and the white is too saturated.</td>', 'Good idea just a little out of focus and the white is too saturated.', '2003-12-27 10:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(523716, 51497, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good picture although I think it would have worked better in the Macro challenge.</td>', 'Good picture although I think it would have worked better in the Macro challenge.', '2003-12-27 10:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(523718, 51661, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think this picture needs more depth of field to be effective. If the short range of focus was deliberate, I would say it''s a mistake. At least the two numbers should be in sharp focus, even if the word balance was a little out.</td>', 'I think this picture needs more depth of field to be effective. If the short range of focus was deliberate, I would say it''s a mistake. At least the two numbers should be in sharp focus, even if the word balance was a little out.', '2003-12-27 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(523719, 52041, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice muted colors. Is that a Monestary?</td>', 'Nice muted colors. Is that a Monestary?', '2003-12-27 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(523721, 52032, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty study in the textures of brick and stones.</td>', 'This is a very pretty study in the textures of brick and stones.', '2003-12-27 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(523723, 52011, 12733, '<td valign="top">The contrast in subject, texture and focus gives this edge a 3-dimensional effect. It gives an illusion of the ice suspended above the trees. Are the trees a reflection?</td>', 'The contrast in subject, texture and focus gives this edge a 3-dimensional effect. It gives an illusion of the ice suspended above the trees. Are the trees a reflection?', '2003-12-27 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(523725, 52097, 12733, '<td valign="top">The curving wall really makes this composition, and the reflections add to the effect of ice and water. Great shot.</td>', 'The curving wall really makes this composition, and the reflections add to the effect of ice and water. Great shot.', '2003-12-27 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(523726, 51733, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on the lighting and the details of the castle. The lights in the foreground add enough interest to make this more than the usual vacation shot.</td>', 'Nice capture on the lighting and the details of the castle. The lights in the foreground add enough interest to make this more than the usual vacation shot.', '2003-12-27 10:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(523728, 51780, 11895, '<td valign="top">good idea but too dark to see much</td>', 'good idea but too dark to see much', '2003-12-27 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(523729, 51437, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful silhouette. Great composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful silhouette. Great composition.', '2003-12-27 10:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523730, 51569, 11895, '<td valign="top">wish this had a little more color in it, title is weak</td>', 'wish this had a little more color in it, title is weak', '2003-12-27 10:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(523733, 52100, 12733, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I think moving the car further back in the picture and having it turned so it is heading into nowhere, rather than out, would have improved this photo a lot.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I think moving the car further back in the picture and having it turned so it is heading into nowhere, rather than out, would have improved this photo a lot.', '2003-12-27 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(523736, 51375, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught the colors and shape of the structure nicely, and the foreground composition is attractive. I think cropping some of the empty blue sky to bring the horizon off center would add drama and create a more effective picture. Try scrolling up gradually to cut off the top, and you''ll see what I mean.</td>', 'You''ve caught the colors and shape of the structure nicely, and the foreground composition is attractive. I think cropping some of the empty blue sky to bring the horizon off center would add drama and create a more effective picture. Try scrolling up gradually to cut off the top, and you''ll see what I mean.', '2003-12-27 10:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(523737, 51395, 14012, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a tad overexposed</td>', 'Seems to be a tad overexposed', '2003-12-27 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(523738, 52046, 14012, '<td valign="top">This would have been much better if the vehicle was clean and shiney.</td>', 'This would have been much better if the vehicle was clean and shiney.', '2003-12-27 10:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(523739, 51415, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of midtown Manhattan and part of Queens. I''d like it a little brighter; I think this would bring out the detail better. I grew up in New York, and I believed the city limits represented the ends of the world, but having lived in other places I have come to realize there is a great world outside of the five boroughs.</td>', 'Nice capture of midtown Manhattan and part of Queens. I''d like it a little brighter; I think this would bring out the detail better. I grew up in New York, and I believed the city limits represented the ends of the world, but having lived in other places I have come to realize there is a great world outside of the five boroughs.', '2003-12-27 10:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(523741, 51296, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2003-12-27 10:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(523742, 51375, 14012, '<td valign="top">Very nice bright colors</td>', 'Very nice bright colors', '2003-12-27 10:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(523744, 51704, 14012, '<td valign="top">I think this might look a little better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I think this might look a little better in B&W.', '2003-12-27 11:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(523745, 52068, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think more even lighting would improve the effect of the "edge" below the apple.</td>', 'I think more even lighting would improve the effect of the "edge" below the apple.', '2003-12-27 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(523747, 52004, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the luster of the gemstone, but the metallic texture of the blade seem lost completely - it looks more like wood. This might need a second light or a reflector to bring out the details of the dual subject.</td>', 'I like the luster of the gemstone, but the metallic texture of the blade seem lost completely - it looks more like wood. This might need a second light or a reflector to bring out the details of the dual subject.', '2003-12-27 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(523757, 51661, 14012, '<td valign="top">I like this. I had thought about doing something similar. Good DOF.</td>', 'I like this. I had thought about doing something similar. Good DOF.', '2003-12-27 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(523760, 52015, 14012, '<td valign="top">good idea. Two things that I think would improve this. 1- come at this from a different angle to make it a little more interesting. 2- if you can submit a larger image, I think it will help.</td>', 'good idea. Two things that I think would improve this. 1- come at this from a different angle to make it a little more interesting. 2- if you can submit a larger image, I think it will help.', '2003-12-27 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(523764, 52012, 14012, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus</td>', 'Seems out of focus', '2003-12-27 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(523771, 52089, 14012, '<td valign="top">Good idea, not so good execution. Maybe if there was just a single "splash" coming over the edge. It''s really hard to tell what I should be focusing on.</td>', 'Good idea, not so good execution. Maybe if there was just a single "splash" coming over the edge. It''s really hard to tell what I should be focusing on.', '2003-12-27 11:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(523774, 51984, 14012, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the sun is shining down on top of the lower storm clouds. No real "wow" factor here though.</td>', 'Interesting how the sun is shining down on top of the lower storm clouds. No real "wow" factor here though.', '2003-12-27 11:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(523781, 52086, 14012, '<td valign="top">If you''re going with the OD idea, you may want to flip all the pills over so you can''t tell they are just aspirin. Other than that, looks good.</td>', 'If you''re going with the OD idea, you may want to flip all the pills over so you can''t tell they are just aspirin. Other than that, looks good.', '2003-12-27 11:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(523783, 51725, 14012, '<td valign="top">Maybe try framing vertically with the plane in the top third, to give a hint of what is below.</td>', 'Maybe try framing vertically with the plane in the top third, to give a hint of what is below.', '2003-12-27 11:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(523788, 51415, 14012, '<td valign="top">Nice. I don''t see a need for the big border though. If the "border" is the first thing to jump out, then it is taken away from the photo, IMHO.</td>', 'Nice. I don''t see a need for the big border though. If the "border" is the first thing to jump out, then it is taken away from the photo, IMHO.', '2003-12-27 11:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(523789, 52065, 14012, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright, with good focus.</td>', 'Nice and bright, with good focus.', '2003-12-27 11:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(523793, 51476, 14012, '<td valign="top">If all color is already out of the dead rose, a selective desaturation leaving only the red may have looked neat to bring more life to the live rose.</td>', 'If all color is already out of the dead rose, a selective desaturation leaving only the red may have looked neat to bring more life to the live rose.', '2003-12-27 11:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523794, 52038, 14012, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more contrast</td>', 'Needs a little more contrast', '2003-12-27 11:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(523796, 51878, 14012, '<td valign="top">seems oversharpened</td>', 'seems oversharpened', '2003-12-27 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(523797, 51540, 14012, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this. My favorite of the challenge, so far. Good luck.</td>', 'I like everything about this. My favorite of the challenge, so far. Good luck.', '2003-12-27 11:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(523800, 52011, 14012, '<td valign="top">over-sharpened and pixelated. Makes it very hard to tell what it is. The idea is good though</td>', 'over-sharpened and pixelated. Makes it very hard to tell what it is. The idea is good though', '2003-12-27 11:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(523801, 52099, 14012, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what that big white border is.</td>', 'Not really sure what that big white border is.', '2003-12-27 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
