(524219, 51885, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull image full of shapes, texture and edges/borders. The oriantation you choose make it very special: needs some time to realize what it is.<br/>I especially like the lower right part, where the water is very shallow and the next wave is comming.</td>', 'Wonderfull image full of shapes, texture and edges/borders. The oriantation you choose make it very special: needs some time to realize what it is.I especially like the lower right part, where the water is very shallow and the next wave is comming.', '2003-12-28 03:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(524228, 52125, 15199, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. I like the reflections and the shadows.</td>', 'Very good composition. I like the reflections and the shadows.', '2003-12-28 04:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(524229, 51651, 15199, '<td valign="top">Great shot, especially the non-conventional lines made by the picture. Also fools the concept of where up is up, nice color balance too!</td>', 'Great shot, especially the non-conventional lines made by the picture. Also fools the concept of where up is up, nice color balance too!', '2003-12-28 04:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
