(524239, 52079, 15199, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, pity on the overall brown tinge of the picture. A different color background might have produces a stronger effect</td>', 'Very good idea, pity on the overall brown tinge of the picture. A different color background might have produces a stronger effect', '2003-12-28 04:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(524241, 51877, 13403, '<td valign="top">a lot of \"photographers\" like to use words like \"distracting\", \"exposure\", \"color\", and other multi-syllabic jargon to throw you off..  don\''t listen to them, they\''re probably just here trying to impress their girlfriend/boyfriend..   this photograph is special to me, because it just screams:  \"GOD\"..    very unsettling actually... but special.. i guess..    hrmm.   my thoughts on GOD...    EXISTENCE IS RELATIVE TO THE INDIVIDUAL MIND-  take THAT, philosophy and religion...  if you believe something exists- to the point of its \"existence\" (be it \''false\'' or not) having an affect on your life.. (a very real affect) then why, pray tell, would you go around telling people that they\''re wrong and you\''re right?    (now, \"existence being relative to the individual\" is my own \"over simplify everything\" concept/theory.    not unlike your \"god\", the legitamacy of my existence theory can\''t actually be disproven... or proven for that matter.. (but at least i\''m not pushing my belief over anyone else\''s..  )<br/>hmm..  what is the non-physical reality called again?<br/> <br/>7 (cuz i like the colors and texture)</td>', 'a lot of \"photographers\" like to use words like \"distracting\", \"exposure\", \"color\", and other multi-syllabic jargon to throw you off..  don\''t listen to them, they\''re probably just here trying to impress their girlfriend/boyfriend..   this photograph is special to me, because it just screams:  \"GOD\"..    very unsettling actually... but special.. i guess..    hrmm.   my thoughts on GOD...    EXISTENCE IS RELATIVE TO THE INDIVIDUAL MIND-  take THAT, philosophy and religion...  if you believe something exists- to the point of its \"existence\" (be it \''false\'' or not) having an affect on your life.. (a very real affect) then why, pray tell, would you go around telling people that they\''re wrong and you\''re right?    (now, \"existence being relative to the individual\" is my own \"over simplify everything\" concept/theory.    not unlike your \"god\", the legitamacy of my existence theory can\''t actually be disproven... or proven for that matter.. (but at least i\''m not pushing my belief over anyone else\''s..  )hmm..  what is the non-physical reality called again? 7 (cuz i like the colors and texture)', '2003-12-28 04:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(524242, 51994, 15199, '<td valign="top">The strong white hightlights distract from the borders of the flower. Unsure of where focus stands. Good idea and perfect composition.</td>', 'The strong white hightlights distract from the borders of the flower. Unsure of where focus stands. Good idea and perfect composition.', '2003-12-28 04:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(524243, 51953, 15199, '<td valign="top">Amazing macro, if only the squatter was visible showing impending death!!</td>', 'Amazing macro, if only the squatter was visible showing impending death!!', '2003-12-28 04:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(524244, 52026, 15199, '<td valign="top">Very unclear emphasis on the pills. Maybe cropping on the hands area would have given more weight on the moment.</td>', 'Very unclear emphasis on the pills. Maybe cropping on the hands area would have given more weight on the moment.', '2003-12-28 04:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(524246, 52036, 15199, '<td valign="top">I strangely see a discontinuity on the upper quater of the egg, could be my monitor though.</td>', 'I strangely see a discontinuity on the upper quater of the egg, could be my monitor though.', '2003-12-28 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(524247, 52010, 13403, '<td valign="top">ah.. the pea faces a very difficult choice...  there are tremendous consequences confusing every aspect of this decision..   will the pea jump off the plate (his home for as long as he can remember) into the unknown darkness?     The darkness may well never end, but is mr. pea ready for the grand adventure?   the journey is certainly not for the squeamish-   what would you do in this position?   would you take your chance on the unknown?  or would you surrender to the comfort of familiarity?    i, myself am torn.  (7)</td>', 'ah.. the pea faces a very difficult choice...  there are tremendous consequences confusing every aspect of this decision..   will the pea jump off the plate (his home for as long as he can remember) into the unknown darkness?     The darkness may well never end, but is mr. pea ready for the grand adventure?   the journey is certainly not for the squeamish-   what would you do in this position?   would you take your chance on the unknown?  or would you surrender to the comfort of familiarity?    i, myself am torn.  (7)', '2003-12-28 04:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(524249, 52079, 13403, '<td valign="top">it looks like you painted scrappy hair on the underside of this egg..  if you turn it upside down, paint eyes and a mouth on it, it''d practically be me already.. and that''s WITHOUT the badass third eye tattoo i have... (i wish) :-P  (6)</td>', 'it looks like you painted scrappy hair on the underside of this egg..  if you turn it upside down, paint eyes and a mouth on it, it''d practically be me already.. and that''s WITHOUT the badass third eye tattoo i have... (i wish) :-P  (6)', '2003-12-28 04:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(524250, 51990, 15199, '<td valign="top">Good idea, unfortunately the blade is not very well defines and the hot bar on the right is made too soft by the lightning on the right.</td>', 'Good idea, unfortunately the blade is not very well defines and the hot bar on the right is made too soft by the lightning on the right.', '2003-12-28 04:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
