(524253, 52081, 13403, '<td valign="top">why?  what happens when you draw off the edge?    it has its compositional values at times, doesn''t it??  WHY WOULD YOU RESTRICT ME!!  I AM AN ARTIST, I''LL DRAW WHEREVER THE F**K I PLEASE!     *aww drat, i got charcoal in my eye..</td>', 'why?  what happens when you draw off the edge?    it has its compositional values at times, doesn''t it??  WHY WOULD YOU RESTRICT ME!!  I AM AN ARTIST, I''LL DRAW WHEREVER THE F**K I PLEASE!     *aww drat, i got charcoal in my eye..', '2003-12-28 04:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
