(524255, 51887, 13403, '<td valign="top">it looks like a trap...      hehe, i can just see a pudgy kid running after it salivating like a wild animal -  what a SHOCK he''s in for.. ( PUUUUN )   *ahem..  i hate to toot my own horn, but...  TOOOOOOOOOOT</td>', 'it looks like a trap...      hehe, i can just see a pudgy kid running after it salivating like a wild animal -  what a SHOCK he''s in for.. ( PUUUUN )   *ahem..  i hate to toot my own horn, but...  TOOOOOOOOOOT', '2003-12-28 04:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
