(524747, 52117, 15413, '<td valign="top">A very clever play on the subject. Well conceived and executed. I like how the edje starts in focus and then blurs into the apple slice.</td>', 'A very clever play on the subject. Well conceived and executed. I like how the edje starts in focus and then blurs into the apple slice.', '2003-12-28 22:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
