(524752, 52034, 15413, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy images that show the transition between states. This is a very good composition showing the chaotic edge of ice. Nice photo.</td>', 'I always enjoy images that show the transition between states. This is a very good composition showing the chaotic edge of ice. Nice photo.', '2003-12-28 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(524757, 51468, 14891, '<td valign="top">and running on the escillator of life. nice shot!</td>', 'and running on the escillator of life. nice shot!', '2003-12-28 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(524787, 51429, 14620, '<td valign="top">Like the idea of the gun also the perspective of it but I think the border is kind of distracting to the shot and also to the message I think you''re trying to convey.  I would''ve like it better without it.</td>', 'Like the idea of the gun also the perspective of it but I think the border is kind of distracting to the shot and also to the message I think you''re trying to convey.  I would''ve like it better without it.', '2003-12-28 23:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(524789, 52015, 14620, '<td valign="top">I think we lose a lot of details due to the size of the picture, would''ve like to have seen it larger.  I like the colors and textures of it.</td>', 'I think we lose a lot of details due to the size of the picture, would''ve like to have seen it larger.  I like the colors and textures of it.', '2003-12-28 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(524796, 51686, 14620, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh, shadows are too prevalent here.  Might try to use more fill lighting to reduce the shadows a little.  Good color choices.</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh, shadows are too prevalent here.  Might try to use more fill lighting to reduce the shadows a little.  Good color choices.', '2003-12-28 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(524874, 52099, 2792, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the photo is noisy and it could have used better lighting.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the photo is noisy and it could have used better lighting.', '2003-12-29 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(524939, 51520, 13438, '<td valign="top">Great picture, concept, angle, lay-out, mood. gave you 8<br/>DOF-wise, I would have personally given more, setting sharpness  a little nearer the camera to show more of the landscape from the snails'' point of view</td>', 'Great picture, concept, angle, lay-out, mood. gave you 8DOF-wise, I would have personally given more, setting sharpness  a little nearer the camera to show more of the landscape from the snails'' point of view', '2003-12-29 02:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(524941, 52079, 13438, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but I find you didn''t go far enough regarding lightbalance (from my screen, very weak contrast, very yellowish) and /or background. Still love the "moment-just-before" feeling.</td>', 'Love the idea, but I find you didn''t go far enough regarding lightbalance (from my screen, very weak contrast, very yellowish) and /or background. Still love the "moment-just-before" feeling.', '2003-12-29 02:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(524949, 52057, 13438, '<td valign="top">Perfect match with topic, setup, background, lighting.You would probabely touch up the deranging lightpoint in the back of the glass on top if it was''nt for RULES. Kwality (K for Kiwi)</td>', 'Perfect match with topic, setup, background, lighting.You would probabely touch up the deranging lightpoint in the back of the glass on top if it was''nt for RULES. Kwality (K for Kiwi)', '2003-12-29 03:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(524952, 51517, 13438, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the interpretation, being the psychological edge, the way you framed and DOF ( not to forget what your model went trough ;)) Altough I personally like grain, YOU probably will suffer scorewise</td>', 'I appreciate the interpretation, being the psychological edge, the way you framed and DOF ( not to forget what your model went trough ;)) Altough I personally like grain, YOU probably will suffer scorewise', '2003-12-29 03:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(524957, 51885, 13438, '<td valign="top">Love this pic, maybe interesting to try a slower speed to have a less "mineral" feeling to the water.</td>', 'Love this pic, maybe interesting to try a slower speed to have a less "mineral" feeling to the water.', '2003-12-29 03:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(525031, 51893, 5158, '<td valign="top">While the image fits well to the challenge (bounderies, transition), it could have been improved by a tighter cropping at the top and maybe a desaturation of all colors except red. Also a black boarder might have worked well here.<br/>As it is now, it looks a little "snap-shooty".</td>', 'While the image fits well to the challenge (bounderies, transition), it could have been improved by a tighter cropping at the top and maybe a desaturation of all colors except red. Also a black boarder might have worked well here.As it is now, it looks a little "snap-shooty".', '2003-12-29 05:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(525034, 51429, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the topic, the composition and its technically well made.<br/>But the border!? Why did you choose these strong colors?<br/>Still, a 7 from me</td>', 'I like the topic, the composition and its technically well made.But the border!? Why did you choose these strong colors?Still, a 7 from me', '2003-12-29 05:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(525073, 52040, 5158, '<td valign="top">It''s a little to straight for me to get a high vote. While it for sure shows a border, I different angle might have imnproved the image very much. Also taking away the dirt might have been better.</td>', 'It''s a little to straight for me to get a high vote. While it for sure shows a border, I different angle might have imnproved the image very much. Also taking away the dirt might have been better.', '2003-12-29 06:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(525083, 52037, 5158, '<td valign="top">Having access to such a great animal, you should have put more thought into composing the image instead of just a snapshot.<br/>The car in the back, the wooden wall with the reflections disturb much. Also the skin colour is a little bit too red and overexposed. <br/>However, with the title it fits the challenge well. A 5 from me.</td>', 'Having access to such a great animal, you should have put more thought into composing the image instead of just a snapshot.The car in the back, the wooden wall with the reflections disturb much. Also the skin colour is a little bit too red and overexposed. However, with the title it fits the challenge well. A 5 from me.', '2003-12-29 06:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(525098, 51934, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost, almost ... my questions would be: cropping - why so much negative space (or alternatively, why so little)? Why so little contrast range ... I understand what your title implies, but would a touch more light and shade really hurt it so much? the curves and planes of these objects ought to allow for a wonderful range of shade, and I think you''ve bleached that out of it a little with the lighting.</td>', 'Almost, almost ... my questions would be: cropping - why so much negative space (or alternatively, why so little)? Why so little contrast range ... I understand what your title implies, but would a touch more light and shade really hurt it so much? the curves and planes of these objects ought to allow for a wonderful range of shade, and I think you''ve bleached that out of it a little with the lighting.', '2003-12-29 07:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(525157, 52099, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit to grainy for my tastes</td>', 'A bit to grainy for my tastes', '2003-12-29 07:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
