(525638, 51540, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the message that this shot gives me, it reminds me to Matrix when Neo pulls his hand from the liquid mirror. B&amp;W works well here, and I like the composition, too. Good luck. :-)</td>', 'I like the message that this shot gives me, it reminds me to Matrix when Neo pulls his hand from the liquid mirror. B&W works well here, and I like the composition, too. Good luck. :-)', '2003-12-29 15:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(525646, 52065, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo! :-) Amazing colours and composition, maybe the trunk in the foreground could be a bit sharper. I am sooo jealious that you live near places like this oneeeee! :-)</td>', 'Wonderful photo! :-) Amazing colours and composition, maybe the trunk in the foreground could be a bit sharper. I am sooo jealious that you live near places like this oneeeee! :-)', '2003-12-29 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(525647, 51521, 3080, '<td valign="top">What''s illegal?  I can''t tell what this guy is doing.  Is he trying to take a leak on the side of the road?  Did he spray paint something on that pole?  Is it illegal for a man wearing a suit to overlook a town on tuesdays at noon?  The man is pretty dark.  Can''t tell if he''s trying to hide something in his coat or if he''s trying to take a leak.  The conditions make the photo a bit washed out in places.  Focus seems ok, but also hard to tell cause of the lighting.  There isn''t a lot of detail here.  I think you had an idea, but it doesn''t come across unless you know exactly what the guy is trying to do.</td>', 'What''s illegal?  I can''t tell what this guy is doing.  Is he trying to take a leak on the side of the road?  Did he spray paint something on that pole?  Is it illegal for a man wearing a suit to overlook a town on tuesdays at noon?  The man is pretty dark.  Can''t tell if he''s trying to hide something in his coat or if he''s trying to take a leak.  The conditions make the photo a bit washed out in places.  Focus seems ok, but also hard to tell cause of the lighting.  There isn''t a lot of detail here.  I think you had an idea, but it doesn''t come across unless you know exactly what the guy is trying to do.', '2003-12-29 15:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(525648, 52092, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, and the thought is good.  I''m not liking the color though.  Seems like maybe the weather was not cooperating much, and had put a haze over your whole image.  All the cars are out of focus and because there are so many of them, seem to me more of a distraction than anything attractive.  The distortion alone the top of your image is also distracting.  What caused this?  You can mainly see it in the upper left on the windows.  It''s a different kind of angle, which does make it interesting, and my issues with the shot are really beyond your control, but better lighting and less cars would definately make this more appealing to me.</td>', 'Interesting angle, and the thought is good.  I''m not liking the color though.  Seems like maybe the weather was not cooperating much, and had put a haze over your whole image.  All the cars are out of focus and because there are so many of them, seem to me more of a distraction than anything attractive.  The distortion alone the top of your image is also distracting.  What caused this?  You can mainly see it in the upper left on the windows.  It''s a different kind of angle, which does make it interesting, and my issues with the shot are really beyond your control, but better lighting and less cars would definately make this more appealing to me.', '2003-12-29 15:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(525650, 51854, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours, I love the shapes of the clouds a much, too! I would be happy to see this one as a top finish! :-)</td>', 'Wonderful colours, I love the shapes of the clouds a much, too! I would be happy to see this one as a top finish! :-)', '2003-12-29 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(525651, 52107, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not sure how I feel about the fence going straight through the center of the image.  I''m not usually a stickler for the "photography rules" but I think this is one image that would benefit from some dramatic angle or something.  I''m guessing that it''s the snow that''s "on the edge" which definately works.  The focus seems a little soft to me though.  I''m wondering if that is because the large post in the bottom left is obviously out of focus, and my eyes really aren''t following that to a place that IS in focus.  The snow looks good in the bottom right, but near the upper part of snow, it seems to be a bit bright and washed out.</td>', 'Not sure how I feel about the fence going straight through the center of the image.  I''m not usually a stickler for the "photography rules" but I think this is one image that would benefit from some dramatic angle or something.  I''m guessing that it''s the snow that''s "on the edge" which definately works.  The focus seems a little soft to me though.  I''m wondering if that is because the large post in the bottom left is obviously out of focus, and my eyes really aren''t following that to a place that IS in focus.  The snow looks good in the bottom right, but near the upper part of snow, it seems to be a bit bright and washed out.', '2003-12-29 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(525653, 51388, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have included your ''edge'' in the photo.  it creates nice angles and framing as well.  I''m trying this with different croppings, and I think I like this with the ugly roof (the rusty dirty green roof on the house in the upper left) cropped off.  The shadows make this interesting.  I like how it adds depth.  You look down and can''t see the ground, makes the ''on the edge'' seem more *gasp*. lol.  Focus and clarity are good.   I like this image.</td>', 'I really like how you have included your ''edge'' in the photo.  it creates nice angles and framing as well.  I''m trying this with different croppings, and I think I like this with the ugly roof (the rusty dirty green roof on the house in the upper left) cropped off.  The shadows make this interesting.  I like how it adds depth.  You look down and can''t see the ground, makes the ''on the edge'' seem more *gasp*. lol.  Focus and clarity are good.   I like this image.', '2003-12-29 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(525658, 51411, 3080, '<td valign="top">What in the world is this?  I was thinking some kind of stapling tool, or something, but I think I''m going to go with a ski?  Not really knowing exactly, only limited things I can say.  I can say that the focus is good, as is the placement of this object.  I''m going to assume it''s a ski.  Is it ''on the edge'' cause you live on the edge if you ski?  anyway, lighting is also good and the background is perfect.  Technically a good shot, just a little confusing to someone who is not familiar with whatever it is.</td>', 'What in the world is this?  I was thinking some kind of stapling tool, or something, but I think I''m going to go with a ski?  Not really knowing exactly, only limited things I can say.  I can say that the focus is good, as is the placement of this object.  I''m going to assume it''s a ski.  Is it ''on the edge'' cause you live on the edge if you ski?  anyway, lighting is also good and the background is perfect.  Technically a good shot, just a little confusing to someone who is not familiar with whatever it is.', '2003-12-29 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(525660, 52035, 13306, '<td valign="top">Simply touched me (10p)</td>', 'Simply touched me (10p)', '2003-12-29 16:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(525666, 51609, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well...there is definately an edge here, however, nothing really appealing in the photo.  To be perfectly honest, here is what I see...  Dead trees, an annoyinly obnoxious white out sky and some soft focus wheat sticking up through some snow.  It definately does have an edge though.  Unfortunately, I dont think weather was cooperating with you this day.  I think it''s to blame for the muted colors, and the soft focus.</td>', 'Well...there is definately an edge here, however, nothing really appealing in the photo.  To be perfectly honest, here is what I see...  Dead trees, an annoyinly obnoxious white out sky and some soft focus wheat sticking up through some snow.  It definately does have an edge though.  Unfortunately, I dont think weather was cooperating with you this day.  I think it''s to blame for the muted colors, and the soft focus.', '2003-12-29 16:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(525668, 52072, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how you caught the gull right at the edge of where the wave makes it''s mark.  I think that''s quite appropriate for this challenge.    Definately different than the roof shots I''ve seen so far. lol.  Although I can live with the shot just as it is, I wonder how it would look had it been a slight bit brighter?  That''s my only possible suggestion here.</td>', 'I like how you caught the gull right at the edge of where the wave makes it''s mark.  I think that''s quite appropriate for this challenge.    Definately different than the roof shots I''ve seen so far. lol.  Although I can live with the shot just as it is, I wonder how it would look had it been a slight bit brighter?  That''s my only possible suggestion here.', '2003-12-29 16:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(525670, 51321, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  Postcard worthy actually.  But I''m not seeing anything ''on the edge''.  Are you refering to the edge of the roof?  I supose with you title, it makes some sense, but I can''t really SEE the solstice in your image, or the border OF the solstice for that matter.  Focus and clarity are really great.  The sky is perfect and I really like this image, just seems kind of loose on the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  Postcard worthy actually.  But I''m not seeing anything ''on the edge''.  Are you refering to the edge of the roof?  I supose with you title, it makes some sense, but I can''t really SEE the solstice in your image, or the border OF the solstice for that matter.  Focus and clarity are really great.  The sky is perfect and I really like this image, just seems kind of loose on the challenge.', '2003-12-29 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(525671, 51437, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately on the edge.  I like how this is silhouetted.  Very nice.  I wish his tail wasn''t fuzzy...but I wouldn''t expect you to wrestly the goat, shave off his tail and then expect him to stand there while you took pics. lol.  It does seem to draw my attention though because the rest of the shot is so sharp, and has defined edges, that the tail is a bit of a distraction.  Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'Definately on the edge.  I like how this is silhouetted.  Very nice.  I wish his tail wasn''t fuzzy...but I wouldn''t expect you to wrestly the goat, shave off his tail and then expect him to stand there while you took pics. lol.  It does seem to draw my attention though because the rest of the shot is so sharp, and has defined edges, that the tail is a bit of a distraction.  Otherwise, very nice.', '2003-12-29 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(525677, 51654, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am really not sure what this is...but it looks like a really nasty public restroom floor.  While your title does state an edge, this doesn''t appeal to me in any way shape or form.  Maybe you''d have to be there to really appreciate the true beauty of your sidewalk.  If that''s so, your photo doesnt do it justice.  It does look like filthy bathroom tile.  I would have also suggested not doing a perfect horisontal with the ''edge''.  Maybe give it some dramatic angle or diagonal or something.</td>', 'I am really not sure what this is...but it looks like a really nasty public restroom floor.  While your title does state an edge, this doesn''t appeal to me in any way shape or form.  Maybe you''d have to be there to really appreciate the true beauty of your sidewalk.  If that''s so, your photo doesnt do it justice.  It does look like filthy bathroom tile.  I would have also suggested not doing a perfect horisontal with the ''edge''.  Maybe give it some dramatic angle or diagonal or something.', '2003-12-29 16:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(525678, 52092, 9602, '<td valign="top">I love how this picture makes you dizzy</td>', 'I love how this picture makes you dizzy', '2003-12-29 16:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(525684, 51877, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks like it has some funky effect applied.  can''t say I''m real fond of it.  I would much prefer this to have been clearer without the effect.  It is a quite powerful image.  I like the angle and the background works well too.  The edge is very clear, and fits the challenge perfectly in my opinion.</td>', 'This looks like it has some funky effect applied.  can''t say I''m real fond of it.  I would much prefer this to have been clearer without the effect.  It is a quite powerful image.  I like the angle and the background works well too.  The edge is very clear, and fits the challenge perfectly in my opinion.', '2003-12-29 16:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(525686, 52088, 3080, '<td valign="top">not really sure why you went this route.  might work for some people I guess but it is not at all appealing to me.  The focus is even hindering the color.  I would think these would be bright colors, but they really seem muted to me.  So it doesn''t even have that going for it.  The arrangement I think could be appealing, but the blackness in the upper left draws my attention away.</td>', 'not really sure why you went this route.  might work for some people I guess but it is not at all appealing to me.  The focus is even hindering the color.  I would think these would be bright colors, but they really seem muted to me.  So it doesn''t even have that going for it.  The arrangement I think could be appealing, but the blackness in the upper left draws my attention away.', '2003-12-29 16:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
