(526064, 52080, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great shot: I feel the motion, hear the waves and how the surfer has to "work" to stay on the edge.<br/>Technically it''s flawless: crisp, great contrast and color and well cropped too.<br/>Probably a winner, for me at least. Good Luck!</td>', 'Great shot: I feel the motion, hear the waves and how the surfer has to "work" to stay on the edge.Technically it''s flawless: crisp, great contrast and color and well cropped too.Probably a winner, for me at least. Good Luck!', '2003-12-30 04:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(526065, 52071, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great concept and well executed. Only the punk part could be a little brighter. Switching the nicely textured background, so that the green one would contrast the dark cloth might have been better. <br/>Anyway, good look with this great submission</td>', 'Great concept and well executed. Only the punk part could be a little brighter. Switching the nicely textured background, so that the green one would contrast the dark cloth might have been better. Anyway, good look with this great submission', '2003-12-30 04:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(526066, 51838, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull cityscape, too sad that it is not very crisp. Also the conection to the challenge topic can''t be seen at a first glance.<br/>What I like is the diffuse glow of the sky.</td>', 'Wonderfull cityscape, too sad that it is not very crisp. Also the conection to the challenge topic can''t be seen at a first glance.What I like is the diffuse glow of the sky.', '2003-12-30 04:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(526068, 51883, 5158, '<td valign="top">To be honest, the image does not give me an edge-felling. My first thoughts were: a coin on a white paper that is palced on a black paper. <br/>A different angle, maybe from below might have been better. I do like the texture in the white part: makes the image more 3D.</td>', 'To be honest, the image does not give me an edge-felling. My first thoughts were: a coin on a white paper that is palced on a black paper. A different angle, maybe from below might have been better. I do like the texture in the white part: makes the image more 3D.', '2003-12-30 04:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(526070, 51661, 5158, '<td valign="top">Looks better then my account, and it''s on the rise by 1% LOL!<br/>The image needs the title to be understood for this challenge, but this applies for most entries this time, so it''s OK.<br/>Technically I like the B&amp;W, the shallow DOF and the contrast, leading to the nice texture on the paper.<br/>Good luck to you</td>', 'Looks better then my account, and it''s on the rise by 1% LOL!The image needs the title to be understood for this challenge, but this applies for most entries this time, so it''s OK.Technically I like the B&W, the shallow DOF and the contrast, leading to the nice texture on the paper.Good luck to you', '2003-12-30 04:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(526071, 52051, 5158, '<td valign="top">While the landscape is very nice, expecially the colors, the image lacks of severe jpeg-artifacts (I''m probably not the first to tell you this). If this is due to the cameras resolution submit somewhat smaller images next time. Otherwise don''t compress that strong, use the whole 150 kB given to us.<br/></td>', 'While the landscape is very nice, expecially the colors, the image lacks of severe jpeg-artifacts (I''m probably not the first to tell you this). If this is due to the cameras resolution submit somewhat smaller images next time. Otherwise don''t compress that strong, use the whole 150 kB given to us.', '2003-12-30 04:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
