(526303, 51893, 10799, '<td valign="top">There does not seem to be a focal point in this photo.  It is cropped or not cropped in an unsightly way at the top of the photo.  The color is poor pehaps a bit of saturation might have helped.</td>', 'There does not seem to be a focal point in this photo.  It is cropped or not cropped in an unsightly way at the top of the photo.  The color is poor pehaps a bit of saturation might have helped.', '2003-12-30 13:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(526304, 52117, 489, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much, but I think this may have worked better with just a little bit more depth of field - maybe enough so that more of the blade and perhaps the chunk of apple was in focus with the rest blurred. As it is, it looks more out of focus than anything else beacuse the tip of the knife is not prominent enough to stand by itself as the focus of the image. I like the composition though.</td>', 'I like this shot very much, but I think this may have worked better with just a little bit more depth of field - maybe enough so that more of the blade and perhaps the chunk of apple was in focus with the rest blurred. As it is, it looks more out of focus than anything else beacuse the tip of the knife is not prominent enough to stand by itself as the focus of the image. I like the composition though.', '2003-12-30 13:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
