(527550, 51885, 7778, '<td valign="top">The little white specks on the beach (see comments by drgsoell and Natator) are reflections of light from the white of sea shells.<br/> <br/> While I could have easily removed them via adjustments to brightness and contrast, their inclusion here was critical to me, because it added a subtle but distinct metaphorical quality (the suggestion of stars on a dark plane) to the photo, which made for poetry to my senses.</td>', 'The little white specks on the beach (see comments by drgsoell and Natator) are reflections of light from the white of sea shells.  While I could have easily removed them via adjustments to brightness and contrast, their inclusion here was critical to me, because it added a subtle but distinct metaphorical quality (the suggestion of stars on a dark plane) to the photo, which made for poetry to my senses.', '2003-12-31 15:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
