(528517, 51569, 12332, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Diana:</b></div><hr/><i>I looked at this photo for about 10 minutes, I would love having this on my wall.<br/>I gave you a 10</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Diana - Thanks!  Actually, I took this one in your home state of Kentucky!  And within seconds of the following winter scene:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=51397" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12332/thumb/51397.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12332/thumb/51397.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12332/thumb/51397.jpg"/></a> <br/>If you look closely, you can detect some snowfall in the Challenge image.<br/>When I get a chance, I''ll try to put it out on DCPrints, might be a couple of weeks, though.</td>', 'Originally posted by Diana:I looked at this photo for about 10 minutes, I would love having this on my wall.I gave you a 10 Diana - Thanks!  Actually, I took this one in your home state of Kentucky!  And within seconds of the following winter scene: If you look closely, you can detect some snowfall in the Challenge image.When I get a chance, I''ll try to put it out on DCPrints, might be a couple of weeks, though.', '2004-01-01 13:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(528525, 51517, 8860, '<td valign="top">I knew this was your shot - you already have a recognisable style. <br/> <br/>I like it, although I actually think the table and hand are unnecessary and introduces a literal angle that''s not needed. My perception of this is more psychological than physically ''hanging off the side of a ledge''.</td>', 'I knew this was your shot - you already have a recognisable style.  I like it, although I actually think the table and hand are unnecessary and introduces a literal angle that''s not needed. My perception of this is more psychological than physically ''hanging off the side of a ledge''.', '2004-01-01 13:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(528556, 51517, 6804, '<td valign="top">I like it just as it is!<br/> <br/>I think the fingers help to show desperation of hanging on. <br/>This guy is on the edge. He''s about to lose it.<br/>I struggle with the grain a little. It might be just a bit too far for me.</td>', 'I like it just as it is! I think the fingers help to show desperation of hanging on. This guy is on the edge. He''s about to lose it.I struggle with the grain a little. It might be just a bit too far for me.', '2004-01-01 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(528913, 52064, 14980, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vadvirag:</b></div><hr/><i>I like the roofs making a leading line. Otherwise I have the feeling you just looked out your window and pushed the button. Good idea, I just miss something, I dunno.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment, and you are right, i did just look out the window, and push the button. Not much time to make considerations about the shots composition, sun was going down, and a cloudless day is rare at this time of the year here.<br/>:-)</td>', 'Originally posted by vadvirag:I like the roofs making a leading line. Otherwise I have the feeling you just looked out your window and pushed the button. Good idea, I just miss something, I dunno.  Thanks for the comment, and you are right, i did just look out the window, and push the button. Not much time to make considerations about the shots composition, sun was going down, and a cloudless day is rare at this time of the year here.:-)', '2004-01-01 18:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
